  <data key="d5">1756370590</data>
</node>
<node id="Polyester-PU">
  <data key="d0">Polyester-PU</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Polyester-PU is a type of polyurethane with ester bonds in polyol segments, which are more biodegradable compared to polyether-PU.&lt;SEP&gt;Polyester-PU is a form of polyurethane mentioned as one of the two types of PU, alongside polyether-PU.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae42540a18795e5e2ad9054b7a0edfc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16c2c8ec44f02a1180cfb4b9e4fb90f</data>
