  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">WPS is a type of waste plastic tested with Galleria mellonella larvae, which showed a preference for pristine plastics instead.&lt;SEP&gt;WPS is a type of waste plastic tested in larval feeding preference studies.</data>
