  <data key="d2">FTIR spectrometer was used to investigate changes in functional groups of PU polymer and frass samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The FTIR spectrometer is a scientific instrument used for analyses, access to which was granted by Professor Jacek Katzer.</data>
