  <data key="d2">Qiagen provided the DNeasy Blood and Tissue kit used for DNA extraction from mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen is a company from Germany that provided the QIAamp PowerFecal DNA Kit used for DNA isolation in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen is a company based in Germany, mentioned as the manufacturer of the Tissuelyser LT bead mill used for homogenization.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen is a company based in Hilden, Germany, that provided the QIAquick PCR Purification Kit used in DNA purification.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen is the company that produces the QiaQuick PCR purification kit used in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen is the manufacturer of the Dneasy PowerSoil kit used for DNA extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen is the provider of the RNeasy Mini Kit used for RNA extraction.</data>
