<node id="Shanghai">
  <data key="d0">Shanghai</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Shanghai is a major city in eastern China that functions as a leading hub for education, research, and industry. It is home to several prominent universities, including Shanghai Jiao Tong University and Tongji University, both of which play central roles in advancing scientific knowledge through affiliated laboratories and research centers. These institutions support a wide range of experimental and applied studies, such as investigations into mealworm feeding behaviors and survival rates under different dietary conditions, including research on Styrofoam-eating mealworms collected from the region.  

Beyond academia, Shanghai is a critical center for biotechnology, pharmaceuticals, chemicals, and related industries. The city hosts numerous companies that provide essential products and services to the global scientific community. These include Majorbio Bio-Pharm Technology Co. Ltd., Aladdin Reagent International, Macklin, and Sigma-Aldrich Co., all of which supply reagents, laboratory materials, and biopharmaceutical products. Specialized manufacturers such as Yi Heng and Shanghai Shuli contribute to laboratory and industrial infrastructure by producing controlled-environment chambers and artificial climate incubators, respectively. Additionally, the presence of Gurado Food Co. highlights the city’s role in the food industry alongside its scientific and technological sectors.  

Overall, Shanghai represents a dynamic intersection of higher education, research, and industrial development. Its universities foster innovation and experimentation, while its diverse range of companies provide critical infrastructure and resources that support both local and international scientific progress. This combination positions Shanghai as one of China’s foremost centers for education, research, and technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Shanghai is a city in China where Tongji University and East China University of Science and Technology are located.&lt;SEP&gt;A city in China where Tongji University is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Shanghai is the city in China where Tongji University and the Shanghai Academy of Agricultural Science are located.&lt;SEP&gt;Shanghai is a city in China where Abbkine Scientific Co., Ltd. is located.&lt;SEP&gt;Shanghai is the city in China where Tongji University and the State Key Laboratory of Pollution Control and Resource Reuse are located.</data>
