  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">XPS is a technique used to characterize elemental content and chemical composition of sample surfaces, applied here to polyether-PU foam and frass.&lt;SEP&gt;XPS is an analytical technique used to study the elemental composition and chemical structure of polyether-PU foam samples.&lt;SEP&gt;XPS is an analytical technique used to study surface chemical changes in polyether-PU foam after digestion.</data>
