<node id="Staphylococcus sp.">
  <data key="d0">Staphylococcus sp.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Staphylococcus sp. is a bacterial genus associated with polyether-PU-fed microbiomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Staphylococcus sp. is a bacterial genus found in the gut microbiota of Tenebrio molitor larvae, linked to degradation of polystyrene and corn straw.&lt;SEP&gt;Staphylococcus sp. is a bacterial strain studied in relation to polystyrene degradation in Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Staphylococcus sp. is a microbial species reported to degrade polyethylene.</data>
