  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Co-author of a study on biodegradation of polystyrene wastes in yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Ding, N. is a co-author of research on biodegradation of polyethylene in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a study on biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Ding, N. is an author of a study on biodegradation of polyethylene in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a study on biodegradation of polystyrene and plastic mixtures in mealworms.</data>
