<node id="Ren, J.">
  <data key="d0">Ren, J.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ren, J. is a researcher and author recognized for contributions to the study of plastic biodegradation, with a particular focus on the role of yellow mealworms (*Tenebrio molitor* larvae) in breaking down polystyrene waste. Ren, J. has co-authored multiple scientific investigations examining how mealworms are capable of ingesting and metabolizing polystyrene, one of the most persistent and problematic plastic pollutants. These studies have explored both the mechanisms and the extent of polystyrene digestion within the larvae, providing evidence that insect-mediated biodegradation could serve as a potential biological approach to mitigating plastic pollution.  

A notable contribution by Ren, J. includes co-authorship of a 2018 study that demonstrated the biodegradation of polystyrene in yellow mealworms, highlighting the ubiquity and feasibility of this process. This research added to the growing body of evidence supporting the use of mealworms as a sustainable solution for reducing plastic waste, offering insights into alternative waste management strategies that leverage natural biological processes. Through this work, Ren, J. has advanced scientific understanding of insect-based biodegradation and its potential applications in addressing global environmental challenges associated with plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of the polystyrene biodegradation study.&lt;SEP&gt;Ren, J. is an author of a study on biodegradation of plastics in Tenebrio genus.&lt;SEP&gt;Ren, J. is a co-author of studies on biodegradation of plastics by mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b79a227bc8e127f6b71fd2edb0e650a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5caa980be616efa237401a957b69019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551c06d3562ff01465354b3a954b1145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648afbc8ee82935d4026f5915152491c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a3d3cf8ea423f7e0f637dddade1bbf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63813cc5cb4812528045bd8f1ced4313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1301f6942d17092ef7b22ac40f19f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b3c26a06ad850bb97d0ca2d9217be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5050676818c53a0ef6d691d3049e923c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3569d74f8a4c9d0851777a5a66284a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90</data>
