<node id="Benbow, E.">
  <data key="d0">Benbow, E.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Benbow, E. is a researcher and author recognized for contributions to the study of plastic biodegradation, particularly focusing on the role of insects in this process. In 2018, Benbow co-authored a study investigating the biodegradation of polystyrene wastes by yellow mealworms (*Tenebrio molitor* larvae). This research explored the capacity of mealworms to consume and break down polystyrene, a persistent plastic pollutant, thereby highlighting their potential role in mitigating plastic waste. Benbow’s work contributes to the broader field of environmental science and waste management by examining biological pathways for addressing plastic pollution through insect-mediated degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of the polystyrene biodegradation study.&lt;SEP&gt;Benbow, E. is an author of a study on biodegradation of polystyrene in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Benbow, E. is listed as an author of a study on biodegradation of polystyrene in yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a referenced study on biodegradation of polystyrene by yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Benbow, E. is a co-author of studies on biodegradation of plastics by mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a3d3cf8ea423f7e0f637dddade1bbf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63813cc5cb4812528045bd8f1ced4313&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a227bc8e127f6b71fd2edb0e650a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3569d74f8a4c9d0851777a5a66284a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1301f6942d17092ef7b22ac40f19f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b3c26a06ad850bb97d0ca2d9217be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551c06d3562ff01465354b3a954b1145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5050676818c53a0ef6d691d3049e923c</data>
