<node id="Fan, R.">
  <data key="d0">Fan, R.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Fan, R. is a researcher and co-author whose work centers on the biodegradation of plastics, with a particular emphasis on polystyrene and polyethylene degradation by insect larvae. Fan, R. has contributed to multiple studies that investigate the ability of yellow mealworms (*Tenebrio molitor*) to consume and digest polystyrene waste, including research that demonstrated the ubiquity of this process and its potential applications for mitigating plastic pollution. In addition to work on mealworms, Fan, R. has co-authored studies on the biodegradation of plastics by *Zophobas atratus* larvae, commonly known as superworms. This includes a 2020 study that examined the capacity of superworms to ingest and break down polystyrene materials, as well as research exploring their ability to degrade both polystyrene and polyethylene. Collectively, these contributions highlight Fan, R.’s role in advancing scientific understanding of insect-mediated plastic degradation, with a focus on the ecological and environmental implications of employing mealworms and superworms as biological agents for managing plastic waste. Through this body of work, Fan, R. has helped to establish a foundation for exploring sustainable, biologically based solutions to the global challenge of plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a 2018 study on ubiquity of polystyrene digestion and biodegradation within yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Fan, R. is an author of a study on biodegradation of polyethylene and polystyrene in Zophobas atratus superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Fan, R. is a co-author of studies on biodegradation of plastics by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Fan, R. is a co-author of a study on ubiquity of polystyrene digestion in yellow mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08257b9745bccf6dfc5ca860da5a96bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79a227bc8e127f6b71fd2edb0e650a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5caa980be616efa237401a957b69019&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5073433ee060ce75e140a6626619108b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c0c246e98a503a16ace92f28394b584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551c06d3562ff01465354b3a954b1145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54215690a971d0637c3a6fa61d10f685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af9ad6e808e93b61ec40d6ba4131fda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f83fc7c1ea25f2ead74aceccfe4cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4652e08c4ac6887914d0deebe761b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc3253e8d41785f994d1c6fcc2b6c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b3c26a06ad850bb97d0ca2d9217be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22e4b8000531766cffd145ef32353af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3569d74f8a4c9d0851777a5a66284a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90</data>
