<node id="PlasticsEurope">
  <data key="d0">PlasticsEurope</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">PlasticsEurope is a leading industry association and recognized data provider that specializes in compiling, analyzing, and publishing statistical information on plastics production, demand, and waste management. Serving as an authoritative reference for both European and global plastics data, the organization is widely cited for its detailed figures on production volumes, recycling rates, and the market distribution of specific polymers, including polyethylene. Its data are consistently used by policymakers, researchers, and industry stakeholders to monitor trends, evaluate market dynamics, and assess progress in areas such as recycling and waste management.  

One of PlasticsEurope’s most significant contributions is its recurring publication series *Plastics – the Facts*, which provides comprehensive annual analyses of the plastics sector. These reports cover European production and consumption patterns while also incorporating global statistics, thereby offering a dual perspective on regional and worldwide developments. Editions such as *Plastics – the Facts 2014/2015*, *Plastics – the Facts 2016*, *Plastics – the Facts 2018*, *Plastics – the Facts 2019*, and *Plastics – the Facts 2020* exemplify the organization’s long-standing role in documenting the state of the plastics industry. Each edition delivers insights into production volumes, demand by sector, recycling performance, and waste management practices, making them essential references for understanding both economic and environmental dimensions of plastics.  

PlasticsEurope’s data have been cited across multiple years, including 2018, 2019, 2020, 2022, and 2024, underscoring its role as a consistent and reliable source of information. Its statistics are frequently used to track global plastic production and consumption trends, as well as to provide detailed breakdowns of polymer distribution, such as polyethylene production levels. By offering authoritative and regularly updated data, PlasticsEurope contributes significantly to international discussions on sustainability, circular economy strategies, and the future of plastics in society.  

In summary, PlasticsEurope is an influential organization that plays a central role in shaping knowledge about the plastics industry. Through its authoritative statistical analyses and its flagship *Plastics – the Facts* reports, it provides essential insights into European and global plastics production, demand, recycling, and waste management, thereby informing decision-making across policy, research, and industry domains.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that provides data on global plastic production and resin type distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;PlasticsEurope is an organization that reported global contributions of different types of plastics, including HDPE, LDPE, and LLDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;PlasticsEurope is cited as the source reporting that annual polystyrene production exceeds 20 million tons per year.&lt;SEP&gt;PlasticsEurope is an organization that published 'Plastics-the Facts 2016'.&lt;SEP&gt;PlasticsEurope is cited as the source of global plastic production statistics in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;PlasticsEurope is an organization that published 'Plastics-The Facts 2022,' a report providing data and insights on plastics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02a57c5d6ee92292f1b1bd3dbe76e612&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825c2784fa66ce67114e4173ed0702f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-896c5c0e4d1805ded38b335876a02f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e38968f22c4cd9bef3f1562e4ca47e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5073433ee060ce75e140a6626619108b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd2f7b94f62fa18de9e02426577d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c42631c88da011b836666dae04cfa11a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457d054c08a16428ed81526fc2ddce41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a228b2d8328bdce2419d34f8f59bc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c07a838ff0a489c73c8319e5011134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1684575ed5f73a2ebe1adc7fbbb3b942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1006283f24aba2aa605f9e719f36cf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326a8dda1cdd196236b9c836192c76f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4652e08c4ac6887914d0deebe761b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e77298fbeb95f87269261b74c2158d5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f7d44b3f99233bb4389ceea0cd62617&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acbe3a2cb3a17985d07d15bed638bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-567c36cf69b624a7ec0d891d3bd15163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c28d5d503e85e3e6ad15cee35d50e98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44bfda02e6c219cb097ec88543433798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c274a59cd5db4cd675bca51f11adb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38283df790b03806f99ca90272a1000f</data>
