<node id="U.S.A.">
  <data key="d0">U.S.A.</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">The United States of America (U.S.A.) is identified as the country of origin and operational base for several prominent scientific and technology companies, including Agilent Technologies Inc., Thermo Fisher Scientific, Cambridge Isotope Laboratories, Inc., Mettler Toledo, PerkinElmer, and OriginLab Corp. These organizations represent a significant portion of the U.S.A.’s contributions to the fields of scientific instrumentation, laboratory research, and analytical technologies. In addition to its role as a hub for leading corporations, the U.S.A. is also referenced in academic and scientific contexts. For example, it appears in the citation of a scientific article published in 2014, underscoring its relevance in scholarly research. Furthermore, the U.S.A. served as one of the geographic sources for biological specimens in experimental studies, specifically as a collection site for *Tenebrio molitor* larvae used to compare polystyrene (PS) consumption rates, as well as for *Tenebrio obscurus* larvae included in related investigations. Collectively, these references highlight the U.S.A.’s importance both as a center for globally recognized scientific enterprises and as a location contributing to biological and environmental research.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States of America is the country where Agilent Technologies Inc. is based.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States of America is the country where Agilent Technologies Inc. and MathWorks Inc. are located.&lt;SEP&gt;The U.S.A. is mentioned as the country where Agilent Technologies Inc. is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-88706f91768bcf0eaa7a49ef2d4b771f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2991bc47bdc7fe9bc0d7c0d3e23f60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb1740bb657b0f90c48ee5e6d75945ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f267b48449a40d614a2f325799752dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3099f2d6fd3abc2f73550f579999b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02a8ea5e75c58dcb9cfbbcd64f37d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7f79551ab9793788cd662ab66bca5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e6ccf223c8c62d59ba994731f546ad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f54f1dd7372cfa3dc5f348864eed2261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d5a9fbe4803ded646c6a5e4d23ca93a</data>
