<node id="Apoptosis">
  <data key="d0">Apoptosis</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Apoptosis is a biological process promoted by oxidative damage in organisms exposed to plastic ingestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Apoptosis is a biological process of programmed cell death, detected in cells using specific assays.&lt;SEP&gt;Apoptosis was indicated by lipidome analysis, showing cell death processes in mealworms during PS biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Apoptosis is programmed cell death triggered by microplastic-induced oxidative damage in organisms.</data>
