  <data key="d2">Abnormal development in organisms was linked to oxidative stress and apoptosis caused by plastic ingestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Abnormal development is a physiological consequence of oxidative damage and apoptosis in organisms exposed to microplastics.</data>
