  <data key="d0">Howe, C.J.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Howe, C.J. is a researcher recognized as an author and co-author of a scientific study investigating the biodegradation of polyethylene by caterpillars of the wax moth, *Galleria mellonella*. In this work, Howe, C.J. contributed to research that explored the potential of wax moth caterpillars to break down polyethylene, a widely used plastic known for its persistence in the environment. The study, frequently cited in the context of plastic biodegradation research, highlighted the biological processes by which these insects may facilitate the degradation of synthetic polymers. Through this contribution, Howe, C.J. is associated with advancing knowledge on innovative, biologically based approaches to addressing plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Howe, C.J. is an author of a referenced study on polystyrene biodegradation by caterpillars of the wax moth Galleria mellonella.&lt;SEP&gt;Howe, C.J. is listed as an author of a study on polyethylene biodegradation by caterpillars.&lt;SEP&gt;Howe, C.J. is an author of a study on polyethylene biodegradation by caterpillars of the wax moth Galleria mellonella.&lt;SEP&gt;Description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Howe, C.J. is an author of a referenced study on polyethylene biodegradation by caterpillars of the wax moth.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e478d12101aa862a23f9dfc7ac8896b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19868f1234aac10de61c710c8352c076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fccc204d8a48c645da49bd7b3175c262&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827853316f7304c444884dc82f757802&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2741fab96df80d452d2d4cc651730521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602bba09eb2c308c400b412f39f4adb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e3ac1a351ece6e7f29ea15d8b1c721d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33180d5b7e1ebfedf8de59ba1a2a2d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f83fc7c1ea25f2ead74aceccfe4cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df24ea37743c236d369911024fc20bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16328c3c685f35501c3639525e997d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5338aa2127367c868a3e7331e1f66225</data>
