  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a study on plastic ingestion preferences of Superworm and Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Luo, L. is an author of a study on biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor insect.&lt;SEP&gt;Luo, L. is one of the authors of a 2021 study on biodegradation of foam plastics by Zophobas aratus larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Luo, L. is an author of a study on gut microbiome changes due to microplastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a study on plastic ingestion preferences of superworm and yellow mealworm.</data>
