<node id="Law, K.L.">
  <data key="d0">Law, K.L.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Law, K.L. is a researcher recognized for significant contributions to the study of plastic production, use, waste, and its environmental impacts, particularly in marine ecosystems. She is a co-author of influential scientific studies that quantify and analyze the scale of plastic waste entering the ocean from land-based sources, including a landmark 2015 paper published in *Science* that provided one of the first global estimates of plastic waste inputs to the ocean. In addition to this work, Law, K.L. has contributed to research examining the broader lifecycle of plastics, including their production, usage patterns, and ultimate fate in the environment. Her co-authored studies have been widely referenced for advancing understanding of the magnitude of plastic pollution, the pathways through which plastics enter marine environments, and the long-term implications of plastic accumulation. Through this body of work, Law, K.L. has played a central role in shaping scientific and policy discussions on plastic waste management and the global challenge of plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Law, K.L. is a co-author of research on global plastic production and fate.&lt;SEP&gt;Law, K.L. is an author of a referenced study on production, use, and fate of all plastics ever made.&lt;SEP&gt;Description not available in text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463ac9dfa68274d35700c61208f4ea85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5d8df2e13d3902379597b08eb0e08db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827853316f7304c444884dc82f757802&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602bba09eb2c308c400b412f39f4adb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33180d5b7e1ebfedf8de59ba1a2a2d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582</data>
