<node id="Yu, H.">
  <data key="d0">Yu, H.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yu, H. is a researcher and author whose work focuses on environmental pollution, particularly the degradation and ecological impacts of plastics. Yu, H. has co-authored multiple studies investigating the biodegradation of polyvinyl chloride (PVC) by insect larvae, with a specific emphasis on Tenebrio molitor (mealworm) larvae. These studies explore the potential of insect-mediated degradation as a biological solution to plastic waste, contributing to the growing body of research on sustainable methods for addressing plastic pollution.  

In addition to work on plastic biodegradation, Yu, H. has contributed to research on microplastics in agricultural soils. In a 2022 study, Yu, H. examined microplastics as an emerging environmental pollutant, analyzing their presence in soil systems, their ecological consequences, and their potential risks to human health. This research highlights the pervasive nature of microplastic contamination and its implications for food security, ecosystem stability, and environmental sustainability.  

Yu, H. has also authored research on marine debris in the northern South China Sea, addressing the distribution and environmental impact of plastic waste in marine ecosystems. This work underscores the broader issue of plastic pollution in aquatic environments and its role in global environmental change.  

Overall, Yu, H.’s research contributions span the biodegradation of plastics by biological agents, the environmental risks of microplastics in terrestrial systems, and the study of marine debris, reflecting a comprehensive engagement with the challenges posed by plastic pollution across diverse ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a study on biodegradation of polyvinyl chloride (PVC) in mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08257b9745bccf6dfc5ca860da5a96bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a7768b61a3d166f2cd01d4e87ac88cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d068dbad68e3ecd909a551f43f82b893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff93a2e1d68c6ed1fcd9f720197238f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5073433ee060ce75e140a6626619108b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72a9944bcd114b6a3be55ad9b596c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95142a3f585446bd848eeedadd1ab713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e3058d086d89f1ce9baa29cbc29bb48</data>
