  <data key="d2">The foundation provided financial support for the study.&lt;SEP&gt;The research study described in the text investigates the ingestion, metabolism, and environmental implications of microplastics (MPS/PS) in mealworms and their trophic transfer.&lt;SEP&gt;The overall scientific study described in the text, investigating the effects of different plastics on yellow mealworms’ mortality, protein content, and degradation efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;The research study investigated the ingestion and degradation of disposable surgical masks by yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;The research study investigates polypropylene (PP) depolymerization and biodegradation using darkling beetle larvae and microbial processes.</data>
