<node id="Elsevier">
  <data key="d0">Elsevier</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Elsevier Ltd. is the publisher of the journal Environmental Pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publishing company responsible for Chemosphere.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publisher of a guide on plastic mulches for vegetable crop production.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publisher of the book 'New and future developments in microbial biotechnology and bioengineering'.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publishing company that hosts the Journal of Hazardous Materials on its website.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publisher of Methods in Enzymology, which included a study on plastic biodegradation in insect larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Elsevier is the publisher of the Journal of Hazardous Materials.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5a228b2d8328bdce2419d34f8f59bc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfa5755e6c9a5eeae3f595d901dff422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4652e08c4ac6887914d0deebe761b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a603837ad5b989bafd614f5eeb8504c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5922f60fcd06ac6ffa27018026871346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c638e6375f0847be0d1116f4846e5e1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f2fc4d98412efb8a792474cc47e558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59879670a8110deb87c1843ffdb71c75</data>
