<node id="University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn">
  <data key="d0">University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn is the academic institution where the authors of the article are affiliated.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn supported the research through a student grant.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn is an academic institution in Poland, hosting the Faculty of Agriculture and Forestry and the Faculty of Geoengineering.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn is the institution where the study was conducted and which provided funding and resources for the research.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn is an academic institution where the Civil Engineering Center is located.&lt;SEP&gt;The University of Warmia and Mazury in Olsztyn supported the research as part of a student grant ('Studencki Grant Rektora' No. 20.450.001-150).</data>
