  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Reticulitermes speratus is a termite species whose gut microbiota includes Protozoa and Spirochaetes that decompose lignocellulose.&lt;SEP&gt;Reticulitermes speratus is a termite species studied for nitrogen fixation genes in its gut microbial community.&lt;SEP&gt;Reticulitermes speratus is a termite species whose digestive tract hosts protozoa and Spirochaetes for lignocellulose decomposition.</data>
