<node id="Gao, S.-H.">
  <data key="d0">Gao, S.-H.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Gao, S.-H. is a researcher and co-author whose work focuses on the biodegradation of synthetic plastics by mealworms, particularly the larvae of *Tenebrio molitor* (yellow mealworms). Gao has contributed to multiple studies investigating the capacity of mealworms to degrade various types of plastics, including polyethylene, polystyrene, and plastic mixtures. These studies have explored both the extent and mechanisms of plastic biodegradation, highlighting the potential role of insect larvae in mitigating plastic pollution. Gao’s research includes investigations into the biodegradation of polyethylene in mealworms, the digestion of polystyrene by yellow mealworms, and the broader ubiquity of polystyrene degradation across mealworm populations. Through this body of work, Gao, S.-H. has contributed to advancing scientific understanding of biological pathways for plastic waste reduction and the potential application of insect-based biodegradation in addressing environmental challenges posed by persistent plastic materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao S.-H. is one of the authors cited in the references section.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao, S.-H. is one of the authors of studies on biodegradation of plastics in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao, S.-H. is listed as a co-author of a referenced study on biodegradation of polyethylene and plastic mixtures in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a 2018 study on ubiquity of polystyrene digestion and biodegradation within yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao, S.-H. is a co-author of the 2018 study on biodegradation of polyethylene and plastic mixtures in mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c16f995987af72f86486559556052e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3569d74f8a4c9d0851777a5a66284a00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19868f1234aac10de61c710c8352c076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0d2f43eebe2309fba46c5335d76df56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e833cbc3a0a6e2c80e1b69da50317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76cb64e0aa4e4039b70799a0df8943d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53f87a406d4812c07e783e6cbfc09606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f83fc7c1ea25f2ead74aceccfe4cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20bc31ca22e33a7b244779745e9eeb73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47c76e5149ac059b1960b533c9e99a5</data>
