<node id="Barley Bran">
  <data key="d0">Barley Bran</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Barley bran was used as a feed for Tenebrio molitor larvae, both with and without Styrofoam, to measure survival rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Barley bran, a protein and lipid-rich feed, was purchased to feed mealworms in the biodegradation experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Barley bran was used as a feed component for mealworms in biodegradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Barley bran is a feeding supplementation strategy that affects mealworms' growth rate, PS consumption yields, and survival.</data>
