  <data key="d2">Circular economy is mentioned as a model supported by the conversion of Tenebrio molitor biomass into useful products such as feed, food, biomaterials, fertilizers, and biofuels.&lt;SEP&gt;Circular economy is a sustainability concept applied in insect production and processing, including Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;The circular economy is a sustainability concept focused on reusing, recycling, and minimizing waste.</data>
