  <data key="d2">The Sturm test is used to characterize physical changes in plastics during biodegradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sturm test was used to determine CO2 evolution resulting from plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sturm test is used in the study to confirm biodegradation by measuring carbon dioxide production from LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads treated with PM S1.</data>
