  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">SEM analysis was performed to study changes in surface structure and texture of LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads after microbial degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM analysis was conducted to study changes in surface structure and texture of LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads after microbial degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;SEM (Scanning Electron Microscopy) analysis is used to observe structural changes on the surface of LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads, confirming biodegradation by showing cracks, holes, and microbial adhesion.&lt;SEP&gt;Scanning Electron Microscopy (SEM) analysis was used to observe and compare the morphological differences in frass from larvae fed with different mask layers.</data>
