  <data key="d2">Biofilm formation was observed as a distortion in bead surfaces after microbial degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Biofilm formation was observed on the surface of LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads inoculated with PM S1 after 14 days of incubation.&lt;SEP&gt;A microbial process observed in the biodegradation of polyethylene.&lt;SEP&gt;Biofilm formation is a physiological change observed in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3 during PS degradation under anaerobic conditions.</data>
