  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Hexadecane is a hydrocarbon used to test bacterial hydrophobicity by measuring turbidity reduction when bacterial cells were transferred into it.&lt;SEP&gt;A hydrocarbon metabolite that showed decreased levels across diets compared to control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e4030ea35bee29093c1a8f19bc90774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939fc2ea222a49f84f9bdc11f9801367</data>
