<node id="Table 3">
  <data key="d0">Table 3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Table 3 presents data on carbon dioxide evolution from LDPE, HDPE, and PS beads treated with PM S1, confirming biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 3 presents the forward and reverse primer sequences designed to amplify the 16S ribosomal RNA of Klebsiella oxytoca strains and the alkB gene.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 3 presents the results of hematological examination of blood collected from rats.&lt;SEP&gt;Table presenting metabolites identified in MeOH:H2O extracts after derivatization.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 3 presents the chemical composition of frass, showing six main compounds.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 3 provides specific consumption rates of five types of plastics by Source A mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 3 presents the results of DEB model growth curve fitting, including parameters and goodness of fit values.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a97d5b092508f2e837932274d6b3282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d616d4c3c3199d53c1ae93ebcf3589d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e88a3caade44f7fbc493dfc1c3ca8f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-262bed73e929944e03b9f72769b8196c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51daa29515cc5a431055291627bcb199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d8b17fc7993bee31f7e07e4db97cfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df3b1ec42b9ac5c08513c3b568a399</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756388222</data>
</node>
