<node id="Yang Y">
  <data key="d0">Yang Y</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang Y is a scientific researcher and author recognized for contributions to the study of plastic biodegradation and mineralization by insects. Their work has primarily focused on the capacity of mealworms to degrade and mineralize polystyrene, with several studies published on this subject, including multiple influential papers from 2015. In addition to mealworms, Yang Y has co-authored research investigating the biodegradation of plastics such as polystyrene and polyethylene by other insect species, including waxworms and superworms. This body of work has been widely cited in the scientific literature, highlighting its significance in advancing understanding of biological pathways for plastic degradation. Beyond plastic biodegradation, Yang Y has also contributed to research on nitrogen fixation in mealworms, further broadening the scope of their scientific contributions. Collectively, Yang Y’s research has played an important role in exploring insect-mediated solutions to plastic pollution and in deepening knowledge of the ecological and biochemical processes underlying these interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang Y is an author of a referenced study on biodegradation of vulcanized rubber by a gut bacterium from mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang Y is an author cited in the references, though the full citation is cut off.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang Y is one of the authors of studies on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang Y is an author of research on microbial degradation and valorization of plastic wastes.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang Y is an author of multiple studies on polystyrene biodegradation and mineralization by mealworms and superworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc744f6fa5a9ea876a0423d37eedfc87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a0647afad70038c8052c24eb5a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db0003a7244c51697d0129eb84b8e28e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03980ce7209ce3f1b1c62c6ed9961e27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a69982e6abe36c2a0d4a70b78720ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa884bb7540491e8ab975e29c46d1f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85d18d5d86ed1c061dc44d69e9c09ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550dde13ffd2abcf536dd87f7d4c1b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-146789a250a0dbaae0d8438de692e191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56604c68c2f6221f63a4afa5d457e8ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2961e2aad708e7b78a585260097b4d2e</data>
