  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">IOP Conference Series: Earth and Environmental Science is a scientific publication venue where research on polystyrene biodegradation and plastic waste pollution was published.&lt;SEP&gt;The IOP Conference Series: Earth and Environmental Science is a publication platform where research papers related to earth and environmental sciences are published.&lt;SEP&gt;The IOP Conference Series: Earth and Environmental Science is a publication platform where the referenced paper was published.&lt;SEP&gt;IOP Conference Series: Earth and Environmental Science is a scientific publication that featured a 2018 paper on polystyrene biodegradation and solutions to plastic waste pollution.</data>
