<node id="45-day Experiment">
  <data key="d0">45-day Experiment</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The 45-day experiment tested the effects of plastic diets (PS and PE) on superworms and yellow mealworms, measuring weight changes, plastic consumption rates, and survival outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;An experiment lasting 45 days tested mealworm consumption of PS and PE in different forms.</data>
