  <data key="d2">Unweighted Unifrac was used in NMDS analysis to reveal clustering of gut bacterial communities based on larval species and diets.&lt;SEP&gt;A phylogenetic method used in PCA to assess differences in gut bacterial communities based on diet.&lt;SEP&gt;Unweighted Unifrac is a beta-diversity distance metric used to analyze microbial community differences.</data>
