</node>
<node id="R. Fan">
  <data key="d0">R. Fan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">R. Fan is an author of a study on biodegradation of plastics by superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;R. Fan is listed as an author of a scientific publication on biodegradation of polyethylene and polystyrene in superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;R. Fan is an author of a study on polystyrene digestion and biodegradation by Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;R. Fan is a co-author of a study on plastic biodegradation in superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;R. Fan is listed as an author of a 2018 study on biodegradation of polystyrene in yellow mealworms.</data>
