  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">S.S. Yang is an author of a study on polypropylene biodegradation by insect larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;S.S. Yang is listed as an author of a scientific publication on biodegradation of plastics by Galleria mellonella larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Dr. S.S. Yang is acknowledged for contributions to research on plastic biodegradation and is affiliated with Harbin Institute of Technology.&lt;SEP&gt;S.S. Yang is an author of a study on polystyrene digestion and biodegradation by Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;S.S. Yang is an author of multiple studies (2020, 2021) on biodegradation of plastics by insect larvae.</data>
