  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">L. He is an author of a study on polypropylene biodegradation by insect larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;L. He is an author of the bibliometric analysis of publications on biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;L. He is an author of a study on gut microbiomes and polyester polymer biodegradation in Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;L. He is an author of a study on biodegradation of polypropylene by yellow mealworms and superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;L. He is one of the authors of the study published in Science of the Total Environment.&lt;SEP&gt;L. He is an author of a study on biochar generation using frass of yellow mealworms fed with wheat straw.</data>
