<node id="Guangzhou">
  <data key="d0">Guangzhou</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Guangzhou is a major city in Guangdong Province, China, recognized both as an academic and research hub and as a site for scientific studies on plastic degradation. It is home to significant institutions such as the China National Analytical Center and South China Agricultural University, which contribute to the city’s role in scientific research and higher education.  

In addition to its institutional importance, Guangzhou has served as a key location for experimental studies on the biodegradation of plastics using mealworms (Tenebrio molitor larvae). Research conducted in the region has focused on the capacity of mealworms to ingest and metabolize various types of plastics, including polystyrene (PS), polyethylene (PE), low-density polyethylene (LDPE), and polyvinyl chloride (PVC). Studies in Guangzhou have documented measurable degradation effects, such as a 36.9% loss of PE, and have examined the larvae’s plastic consumption rates, ingestion, and metabolic pathways. These investigations have positioned Guangzhou as one of the primary regions in China contributing to the understanding of biological approaches to microplastic and polymer waste management.  

Overall, Guangzhou is notable not only for its scientific infrastructure, exemplified by its research institutions, but also for its role as a site of pioneering studies on the environmental applications of mealworm-mediated plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Guangzhou is a southern region of China where mealworms were collected for the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc215d3abb38f76b4ee0d22c4f1eb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c651f9305c4265540ed7deeb891eae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e50d86c5a0ab8e4188ede9ae519d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ed721221326657b60aadb09faeeac92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236f4db8df75799fa6a0a07921158cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1283355f048671359adcde7d3137af9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89c37eb3e3a5b6ab731f5dbe280aa054</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756385971</data>
</node>
