<node id="Differentially Expressed Genes (DEGs)">
  <data key="d0">Differentially Expressed Genes (DEGs)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">DEGs were analyzed to identify metabolic pathways and enzymes involved in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;DEGs are genes that showed significant expression differences between mealworms fed plastics and wheat bran.&lt;SEP&gt;DEGs refer to genes with significant expression changes in PS- and CS-fed groups compared to CK.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf1f7b81bc271c665d7776cc3114a92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756379154</data>
</node>
<node id="High-Temperature Gel Permeation Chromatography (HT-GPC)">
  <data key="d0">High-Temperature Gel Permeation Chromatography (HT-GPC)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">HT-GPC was used to determine molecular weights (Mn and Mw) and polydispersity index (PDI) of PP, LDPE, and LLDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;HT-GPC was used to determine the molecular weight (Mn, Mw, Mz) of PP.&lt;SEP&gt;HT-GPC is a technique used to determine molecular weights and polydispersity index of PE polymers.&lt;SEP&gt;HT-GPC is an analytical method used to analyze molecular weight changes in plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;High-temperature gel permeation chromatography (HT-GPC) is a technique used to analyze residual PE polymers and determine molecular weight distributions.&lt;SEP&gt;High-temperature gel permeation chromatography (HT-GPC, 1260 Infinity II HT GPC) was used to analyze molecular weight changes in polymers after biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;High-temperature gel permeation chromatography (1260 Infinity II HT GPC) was used to identify depolymerization of PE polymers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-152e743d95b64fab136afadf0304d459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f267b48449a40d614a2f325799752dea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cba3b06dd82e87d3b582bc21c475868&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbedc06292e5cf07fbca1958d8587e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6afbb58ebe9108893daf7e65d59fac39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6eb7955dc484d5f656e1be7b406abb3a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
