  <data key="d0">Experimental Diets</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Mealworms were fed five experimental diets: LDPE, LLDPE, EPS, HIPS, and PP, either alone or co-fed with bran.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms were bred under four experimental diet conditions: bran, PS, bran + antibiotic, and PS + antibiotic.</data>
