<node id="Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes (KEGG)">
  <data key="d0">Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes (KEGG)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">KEGG provides pathway mapping and annotation for differentially expressed genes.&lt;SEP&gt;KEGG is used for annotation and pathway mapping of DEGs.&lt;SEP&gt;KEGG is a database used for functional annotation of unigenes.&lt;SEP&gt;KEGG was used in combination with WGCNA to screen for hub KEGG Orthology enrichment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes (KEGG) is a database used for annotating genetic and metabolic pathways relevant to polystyrene degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9b693d867918f89c9b28997fe94fc830&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa64e5cd2c08637934509262e56ab363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f545e57b1a2b3da8601b4d23e1260c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e69c793c3b67aed7a68bf864c2c7a309</data>
