  <data key="d0">Blast2GO</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Blast2GO is a software tool used for KEGG annotation and pathway mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast2GO (version 5.2.5) is software used for KEGG annotation and pathway mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast2GO is a universal tool for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research.&lt;SEP&gt;A universal tool for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research.&lt;SEP&gt;Blast2GO is described as a universal tool for annotation, visualization, and analysis in functional genomics research.</data>
