<node id="Feeding Control">
  <data key="d0">Feeding Control</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Feeding control refers to the experimental group of worms that were fed only wheat bran.&lt;SEP&gt;Feeding control refers to a comparison group in the experiment, used to assess mortality and growth effects relative to plastic-fed groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Feeding control refers to mealworms that were fed with bran at the same larval age to serve as a control group.&lt;SEP&gt;Feeding control refers to the standard diet used as a baseline comparison in the mealworm feeding experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96aac7c9638ee245b9db5df3ec1d2a1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a522a615bbcac2e06f97f2e4e61975b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1283355f048671359adcde7d3137af9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723</data>
