  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Illumina sequencing was used to perform transcriptome sequencing of mealworm RNA.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina sequencing technology was used to analyze the gut bacterial community composition of insect larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina sequencing of the 16S rRNA gene amplicons was used to analyze bacterial diversity in T. molitor and Z. atratus larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina sequencing was used to analyze the gut microbiome of mealworms under different feeding conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina sequencing is a sequencing technology used in this study to analyze the gut microbiome of mealworms under different feeding conditions.</data>
