<node id="FTIR spectra">
  <data key="d0">FTIR spectra</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">FTIR spectra were used to detect chemical changes such as carbonyl and hydroxyl groups during plastic depolymerization.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR (Fourier Transform Infrared) spectra were used to confirm the biodegradation of PET polymers by detecting changes in chemical bonds.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR spectra were used to analyze the chemical composition of PU1 and PU2, confirming their structural differences.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR spectra were used to analyze chemical changes in polymers recovered from frass.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR spectra were used to analyze residual polyethylene polymers in the frass of T. molitor and T. obscurus larvae.</data>
