  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Unsaturated fatty acids were found at higher levels in mealworms fed 13C-labeled PS compared to bran-fed worms.&lt;SEP&gt;Nutrients present in Tenebrio molitor larvae that contribute to their nutritional value.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of fatty acid in mealworms where δ^13C values were significantly higher when fed ^13C-labeled PS.</data>
