  <data key="d2">13C-labeled polystyrene was used in experiments to track fatty acid production in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;13C-labeled polystyrene (PS) was used as a tracer in feeding experiments to track carbon metabolism in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;13C-labeled PS is a form of polystyrene used in the experiment to trace carbon conversion into CO₂.&lt;SEP&gt;A tracer used in the study to track mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 by mealworms.</data>
