<node id="Benzene">
  <data key="d0">Benzene</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Benzene is a hexatomic ring structure mentioned as similar to isoniazid and styrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Benzene is a chemically stable compound requiring alternative electron acceptors for oxidation under anaerobic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Benzene is a compound studied for anaerobic biodegradation linked to specific bacterial clades.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d4af956dbe737dee68ab6b9834fe2fcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91523cdd8f510a966e9b301a0adb96b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31f2ee9a779791fef2da810debc12720</data>
