<node id="PDI">
  <data key="d0">PDI</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PDI refers to polydispersity index.&lt;SEP&gt;PDI (Polydispersity Index) measures the broadness of polymer molecular weight distribution, which increased after PET biodegradation by T. molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;PDI (Polydispersity Index) is the ratio of Mw/Mn used to measure molecular weight distribution of polymers after biodegradation.</data>
