  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mealworms, specifically larvae of Tenebrio molitor, are studied for their ability to biodegrade polyethylene and plastic mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms, the larvae of Tenebrio molitor, are used in studies for biodegradation of polyethylene, plastic mixtures, and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms (larvae of Tenebrio molitor) were studied for their ability to degrade polyethylene and plastic mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms are the larvae of Tenebrio molitor, used in the study to biodegrade microplastics.</data>
