  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Phylogenetic analysis was performed using AlkB gene sequences from 14 different bacteria with the MegaX software.&lt;SEP&gt;Phylogenetic analysis was performed using AlkB gene sequences from 14 different bacteria to study evolutionary relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;An experimental procedure where bacterial DNA sequences were amplified, sequenced, and compared to construct a phylogenetic tree.&lt;SEP&gt;A phylogenetic analysis of twelve bacterial cells was conducted to evaluate polystyrene degradability using their 16S rRNA sequence.</data>
