<node id="Alkane-1-monooxygenase enzyme">
  <data key="d0">Alkane-1-monooxygenase enzyme</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An enzyme suggested to be responsible for the degradation of polystyrene by Klebsiella oxytoca ATCC 13182 in Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkane-1-monooxygenase enzyme is identified as one of the main enzymes responsible for the degradation of polystyrene by Klebsiella oxytoca.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-678bd592bfdda3f6dd8f2a6659de7fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cdc0cc71ed5e76f044e4db50f81ad2f</data>
