<node id="Edible Insects">
  <data key="d0">Edible Insects</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Insects recognized as a sustainable and protein-rich food source, designated by FAO as a future food resource.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects are insects consumed as food, studied for their nutritional value and sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects such as Tenebrio molitor and Zophobas morio were studied for their ability to consume polystyrene and the resulting nutritional and toxicological impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects are described as one of the oldest animal foods in the human diet, consumed by more than 2 billion people worldwide.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9d01d291012bd548fc067e250ec39fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e67971bdf45c447f2409fddb80e0d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302543e7a2fdb3596cc8a10e7072ec01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-276c82b9935756a3e668c788458ff922</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756384247</data>
</node>
<node id="Sprague-Dawley Rats">
  <data key="d0">Sprague-Dawley Rats</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A laboratory animal model used in the in vivo experiments to test toxicity of Tenebrio molitor larvae powder.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-302543e7a2fdb3596cc8a10e7072ec01</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756372200</data>
</node>
<node id="European Food Safety Authority (EFSA)">
  <data key="d0">European Food Safety Authority (EFSA)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An organization that validated mealworms as edible insects in 2021.&lt;SEP&gt;EFSA is mentioned in the disclaimer, clarifying that the manuscript does not represent its opinion.&lt;SEP&gt;EFSA is a European Union agency based in Parma, Italy, where E.D. Tschatzis is affiliated.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Food Safety Authority (EFSA) is the current affiliation of Dr. Emmanouil Tschatzis, located in Parma, Italy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0d2f43eebe2309fba46c5335d76df56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5922f60fcd06ac6ffa27018026871346&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-302543e7a2fdb3596cc8a10e7072ec01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f83fc7c1ea25f2ead74aceccfe4cf2</data>
