<node id="Endocrine-disrupting chemicals">
  <data key="d0">Endocrine-disrupting chemicals</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Endocrine-disrupting chemicals are released from synthetic substances like EPS and exhibit hormonal activity similar to estrogen.&lt;SEP&gt;Endocrine-disrupting chemicals were studied for their developmental effects in wildlife and humans.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2934b88523093a8bba74cc29a0c775e3</data>
