<node id="Estrogen">
  <data key="d0">Estrogen</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Estrogen is a female hormone mentioned as being mimicked by endocrine-disrupting chemicals released from EPS.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen is a hormone involved in cell growth, differentiation, and proliferation of estrogen-dependent breast cancer cells. It was measured in the study to assess endocrine activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7e755eeac14110dcfdcfc32e51f30b89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2934b88523093a8bba74cc29a0c775e3</data>
