<node id="Tenebrio molitor larvae powder (TMlp)">
  <data key="d0">Tenebrio molitor larvae powder (TMlp)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">TMlp is a powder prepared from Tenebrio molitor larvae, sterilized, dried, and processed for experimental use.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae powder (TMlp) is a feed material derived from larvae, tested with and without expanded polystyrene (eps) feeding.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae powder (TMlp) is the processed form of yellow mealworm used in the study, tested with or without EPS feeding.&lt;SEP&gt;TMlp refers to Tenebrio molitor larvae powder, which was orally administered to Sprague-Dawley rats for 5 weeks in the study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb1c38c1c6dc6fea84d8f51b9f706cd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bf6d17dfbab29bcb302ae97679bc903&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81a3bc3c202af119c80775d5bf23d8b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5911f995d46a77458be83382b8c67f9b</data>
