<node id="Growing pigs">
  <data key="d0">Growing pigs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Growing pigs are used in studies to test the effects of mealworm larvae hydrolysate on nutrient digestibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Growing pigs are the test subjects in studies evaluating nutrient digestibility of dried mealworm larvae compared to animal protein by-products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda</data>
