  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Xia M is a co-author of a study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a study on biodegradation of plastics by superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Xia M is an author of a referenced study on biodegradation of vulcanized rubber by a gut bacterium from mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Xia M is an author of a study on polystyrene biodegradation by superworms.</data>
