  <data key="d0">Gao L</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Gao L is a co-author of a study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of studies on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a referenced study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a study on biodegradation of plastics by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a 2015 study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao L is listed as a co-author of a study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Gao L is an author of studies on polystyrene biodegradation by mealworms.</data>
