  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Entomophagy refers to the consumption of insects as food, discussed as a sustainable protein source.&lt;SEP&gt;Entomophagy refers to the practice of eating insects, which was the subject of consumer attitudes in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Entomophagy refers to the practice of eating insects, which is discussed in the context of consumer willingness and aversion.</data>
