  <data key="d2">Chen is cited as a researcher in studies documenting harmful impacts of plastic pollution on health and biodiversity.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is cited in a 2023 study related to mealworm incubation conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is cited as an author in the referenced studies (Chen et al. 2023). No further description is available in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen is listed as an author with identifier 0000-0002-4790-5873.&lt;SEP&gt;Chen found that Zophobas atratus larvae degrade polystyrene through reactive oxygen species and extracellular oxidase of gut microbes.</data>
