<node id="NR assay">
  <data key="d0">NR assay</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Neutral Red (NR) assay is a laboratory test used to assess cytotoxicity of insect extracts on cells.&lt;SEP&gt;NR assay (Neutral Red assay) is a cytotoxicity test used to measure cell viability, applied to evaluate the effects of insect extracts.&lt;SEP&gt;NR assay was one of the tests used to measure cytotoxicity of insect extracts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db672d5836dfe372ee7c47ee4dd6fbd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4f92fecc6ac55379b7db07587354ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8f677b3b4d06e07d3a58446375133fb</data>
