<node id="Bozek et al. (2017)">
  <data key="d0">Bozek et al. (2017)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Bozek et al. (2017) conducted biochemical assays in mealworms and confirmed reductions in fat and carbohydrate content when mealworms consumed polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6fbbfcf279533f78737706f5751ee5a2</data>
