<node id="Z. morio">
  <data key="d0">Z. morio</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Z. morio, also known as superworm, is an insect species studied for its ability to consume polystyrene and for the cytotoxic properties of its extracts.&lt;SEP&gt;Z. morio is another insect species studied for its ability to degrade Styrofoam, with results showing no negative impact on its health.&lt;SEP&gt;Z. morio is an insect species from which Aeromonas sp. TM1 was isolated.&lt;SEP&gt;Z. morio (superworm) is an insect whose intestinal microbiota contains bacteria capable of degrading polystyrene.</data>
