</node>
<node id="Kosewska, A.">
  <data key="d0">Kosewska, A.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kosewska, A. is a researcher whose work focuses on the biodegradation of plastics and the application of insects in sustainable waste management and agriculture. She has co-authored studies investigating alternative methods of recycling foamed polystyrene through the use of insects, particularly mealworm larvae (Tenebrio molitor). Her research has examined the gut microbiome and enzymatic activity of Tenebrio molitor larvae as they biodegrade plastic waste, providing insights into the microbial and biochemical processes that enable these insects to break down synthetic polymers. This line of work includes both a 2019 study on the gut microbiome of Tenebrio molitor larvae involved in waste biodegradation and a 2020 study that further explored enzymatic changes and microbial dynamics during plastic degradation. In addition to her contributions to plastic biodegradation research, Kosewska, A. has also co-authored studies on the agricultural applications of insect-derived products, including research on the use of mealworm larvae meal as a fertilizer for wheat seedlings. Collectively, her work highlights the potential of insects as agents of environmental remediation and as contributors to sustainable agricultural practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Kosewska, A. is an author of a study on gut microbiome and enzymatic profile of Tenebrio molitor larvae biodegrading cellulose, polyethylene, and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of a study on gut microbiome and enzymatic profile of Tenebrio molitor larvae biodegrading waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Kosewska, A. is a co-author of research on gut microbiome and enzymatic profiles of Tenebrio molitor larvae degrading plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author in a study on gut microbiome and enzymatic profile of Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Kosewska, A. is an author of a study on gut microbiome and enzymatic profile of Tenebrio molitor larvae biodegrading waste.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79e833cbc3a0a6e2c80e1b69da50317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97444337eddb4e9e3d88bde93ce02aef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d1301f6942d17092ef7b22ac40f19f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2741fab96df80d452d2d4cc651730521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e3ac1a351ece6e7f29ea15d8b1c721d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5073433ee060ce75e140a6626619108b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bd2f7b94f62fa18de9e02426577d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56af93e805daf3987d95ff99ab8e891d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-767a2e5a2bde762f9c1b3dbbf7746d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38283df790b03806f99ca90272a1000f</data>
