<node id="MPS (Microplastics)">
  <data key="d0">MPS (Microplastics)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MPS refers to microplastics that were fed to mealworms to study their consumption, degradation, and effects on survival and development.&lt;SEP&gt;MPS refers to microplastics ingested by mealworms. Feeding on MPS causes weight loss, higher mortality, and developmental issues in mealworms.</data>
