<node id="YLS (Young Larval Stage)">
  <data key="d0">YLS (Young Larval Stage)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">YLS refers to the young larval stage of mealworms, characterized by low MPS consumption and high mortality when fed MPS.</data>
