  <data key="d5">1756372633</data>
</node>
<node id="MLS (Middle Larval Stage)">
  <data key="d0">MLS (Middle Larval Stage)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MLS refers to the middle larval stage of mealworms, showing moderate MPS consumption and oxidation effects but no depolymerization.&lt;SEP&gt;MLS refers to the middle larval stage of mealworms, where mortality is high under microplastic feeding, but survival improves when bran is included.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98f748ef0b9e55c370617ad91bcf219c</data>
