<node id="Fig. 4A">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 4A</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fig. 4A presents mortality data of mealworms fed with MPS alone at different larval stages (YLS, MLS, OLS).&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 4A shows FTIR spectra comparisons between PS feedstock and frass samples, highlighting chemical changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 4A depicts variance analysis of Mn, Mw, and Mc reductions across three polyethylene types.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c818a01113d8c07554629cc5edfd28f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a522a615bbcac2e06f97f2e4e61975b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8</data>
