  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Fig. 4B presents mortality data of mealworms in bran cofed groups at different larval stages (MLS, OLS).&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 4B shows FTIR spectra comparisons between PS feedstock and frass samples, highlighting chemical changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 4B shows mealworms consuming EPS insulation material and other PS wastes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc6b858a4eb57553f5b1ae041e1c7160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a522a615bbcac2e06f97f2e4e61975b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c818a01113d8c07554629cc5edfd28f9</data>
