<node id="Reproduction Buffer">
  <data key="d0">Reproduction Buffer</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A threshold of energy reserves required for mealworm pupation, influenced by nutrient intake.&lt;SEP&gt;The reproduction buffer is an energy reserve accumulated during the larval phase, which triggers pupation once it exceeds a critical value.&lt;SEP&gt;The reproduction buffer refers to the energy reserves accumulated by larvae, which are necessary to form pupae and continue development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a97d5b092508f2e837932274d6b3282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0</data>
