<node id="Fish">
  <data key="d0">Fish</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Fish are animals traditionally fed with mealworms as a high-protein food source.&lt;SEP&gt;Fish are marine organisms mentioned as being affected by plastic residues.&lt;SEP&gt;Fish are marine animals that accidentally swallow plastic nanoparticles, leading to indirect human consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Fish are organisms that ingest microplastics, leading to accumulation in the food chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-918d0788c95399a6714bd40c688594de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7cbc8be34e0de8aebc6fd547bacc627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568e2e90ce0d3bbb4e21079f4252f5de</data>
