  <data key="d0">Lwanga et al. (2017)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lwanga et al. (2017) is a cited research group or author team that confirmed high concentrations of microplastics in chicken feces after ingestion of microplastics-fed earthworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de</data>
