  <data key="d0">Lei Zhao</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lei Zhao is one of the authors of the study on PET biodegradation in Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Lei Zhao contributed to methodology.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of the study on impacts of polyethylene properties on biodegradation in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Lei Zhao contributed to conceptualization and experimental design.&lt;SEP&gt;Lei Zhao is listed as one of the authors of the study on biodegradation of low-density polyethylene in mealworms.</data>
