<node id="Beijing">
  <data key="d0">Beijing</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Beijing is the capital city of China and serves as one of the nation’s most important political, economic, scientific, and cultural centers. As the seat of the central government, it plays a pivotal role in shaping China’s political landscape while also functioning as a hub for commerce, industry, education, and research. The city hosts a wide range of enterprises and institutions that reflect its diverse industrial and academic profile, making it a dynamic center of both traditional manufacturing and modern technological innovation.  

Economically, Beijing is home to numerous companies spanning energy, biotechnology, digital technology, and industrial production. Notable enterprises include CECEP Railroad Technology Co., Ltd., CECEP Digital Technology Co., Ltd., Sinopharm Chemical Reagent Co., Ltd., Foring Science Instrument Technology Development Co., Ltd., Aoboxing Biotechnology Co., Ltd., and the China Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection Group, which underscores the city’s role in sustainability and environmental protection. Additional industrial and commercial contributors such as Yixing Plastic Factory, Zizhuqiao Flower and Bird Fish Market, Ruizhihanxing Company, the Daxing Insect Breeding Plant, and SINOPEC Beijing Yanshan Company highlight the city’s breadth of activity across manufacturing, trade, and energy sectors. Biotechnology firms such as Tiangen Biotech, a supplier of DNA extraction kits, and Mei5 Biotechnology further reinforce Beijing’s position as a center for life sciences and applied research.  

Beijing is equally significant in the realm of higher education and scientific advancement. It is home to leading institutions such as Beihang University and the Beijing Institute of Technology, both of which contribute to research in engineering, technology, and environmental sciences. The Beijing Institute of Technology has been particularly influential in biodegradation studies, including pioneering research on the ability of *Tenebrio molitor* (mealworms) to degrade polystyrene (PS). Experiments conducted in the city have used isotopically labeled PS to track assimilation into biomass, with mealworms sourced from Beijing serving as key biological material. The city was also the site where the type strain of *Mixta tenebrionis* was isolated from *Tenebrio molitor*, further emphasizing its role in microbiological and environmental research.  

Overall, Beijing is not only the political capital of China but also a global city with multifaceted significance. Its contributions span governance, industry, biotechnology, biodegradation research, energy conservation, and sustainable environmental practices. By integrating political leadership with scientific innovation and economic diversity, Beijing stands as a central driver of China’s development and a key player in addressing global challenges related to technology, sustainability, and the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The capital city of China, location of China Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection Group.&lt;SEP&gt;Beijing is a city in China where Biolab Technology Co., Ltd. is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-77817419b966e501f1106866cbea7350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b759b81206d0e33e320f2d61e540ae47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4304c39ef3427872131caf77e7cdb438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89c37eb3e3a5b6ab731f5dbe280aa054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4443da1fe36ec7133cd5add18d1957a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e37da2fbe64f85c50c36da45006f4c23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aa972c0f1c2838103f61cd8ae101a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c638e6375f0847be0d1116f4846e5e1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c5fc4d4324334254706d6d5f9312276&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c808bc1867233246c6ad41186de9452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f3365d0b08e5e77183d813ce6a1049&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04683827a8d88bc2fa28ae73ccc0714f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acbe3a2cb3a17985d07d15bed638bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-146789a250a0dbaae0d8438de692e191&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1498160e7767dd16008724d09b2ac64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11de08c24a626abb11d37d71e9567e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56c8b21b1eaba7633b49cea16714ddc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c274a59cd5db4cd675bca51f11adb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e340b8704554cdc28486ac37e78ab0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bf827d2b1d02488e17469a22da9e252&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ab7dd83bf51674598c6a5bdd146b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0b175969d87b3be377f65b988d0a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a27dff473ed210517e6461ad3e5d783</data>
