<node id="Ideonella sakaiensis 201-F6">
  <data key="d0">Ideonella sakaiensis 201-F6</data>
  <data key="d1">organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Ideonella sakaiensis 201-F6 is a bacterium with high PET degrading capacity, though its PET degradation half-life is much longer than that of T. molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideonella sakaiensis 201-F6 is a PET-degrading bacterium reported to achieve 75% PET reduction in 75 days with low-crystallinity PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Ideonella sakaiensis 201-F6 is a bacterial strain within Proteobacteria reported as a PET-degrading bacterium.</data>
