  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A systematic analysis performed using LC-MS to understand pathways of PET biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolome analysis indicated synergistic metabolic pathways of biodegradation, mineralization, and assimilation by the gut microbiota and host larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;An untargeted metabolomics study performed to identify key metabolites during PET biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d5f4bda412174e8b173f180d9b4311ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0efd7a9e4443dc5d3dfe588c7f7efc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b715dc0bf578795b387fe1255d07f22</data>
