  <data key="d2">PET bottles were studied for their degradation potential in marine environments.&lt;SEP&gt;The marine environment is studied in relation to polystyrene sources, additives, transport, behavior, and impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The marine environment is described as being impacted by persistent plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to ecosystems threatened by drifting polymeric materials.</data>
