  <data key="d2">Microplastics are defined as plastic particles smaller than 0.1 mm, which T. molitor larvae can consume when mixed with wheat bran and adhesive.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics (MP) are plastic particles larger than 2 μm detected after biodegradation of foams.</data>
