  <data key="d0">American Society for Testing and Materials (ASTM)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ASTM is an organization that has developed methods for evaluating the biodegradation of plastics and polymers under aerobic or anaerobic conditions.</data>
