<node id="International Standards Organization (ISO)">
  <data key="d0">International Standards Organization (ISO)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ISO is an organization that has defined standards for evaluating the biodegradation of plastics, focusing on chemical changes such as oxidation.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization cited in the study for its definition of biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Standards Organization (ISO) is referenced in relation to ISO 472:2013/Am1:2018 Plastics Vocabulary.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e25fe1af3bede4605e7b94d457c9634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b12468cce513394dbebb8b4ce27f62d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b47eb2d42413e11dbd4e9bb9f2df12f</data>
