<node id="Proton Nuclear Magnetic Resonance (1H NMR)">
  <data key="d0">Proton Nuclear Magnetic Resonance (1H NMR)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">1H NMR is a spectroscopy method used to study chemical modifications of polymers after biodegradation by analyzing hydrogen-1 nuclei.&lt;SEP&gt;1H NMR is an analytical method used in biodegradation studies to characterize plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;1H NMR spectroscopy was used to characterize the polymer's functional groups.</data>
