  <data key="d2">Cannibal rate (CR) is a physiological parameter measured in larvae during experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Cannibal rate (CR) is a physiological parameter of larvae, calculated as the percentage of disappeared larvae relative to the initial number.</data>
