  <data key="d0">Differential Scanning Calorimetry (DSC)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">DSC is used to study crystallization temperature and melting processes of PS and frass samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential scanning calorimetry (DSC) was used to assess the PS material.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential scanning calorimetry (DSC) was used to confirm the nature of polystyrene material, including matching FTIR spectra and glass transition temperature.</data>
