<node id="PS-fed larvae">
  <data key="d0">PS-fed larvae</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PS-fed larvae are a group of T. molitor larvae that were fed only polystyrene (PS) as their diet.&lt;SEP&gt;PS-fed larvae are mealworms fed with PS-containing diets, showing metabolic stress and enzymatic activity changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Larvae that were fed with PS diet, showing distinct gut microbial composition and higher abundances of certain bacterial genera such as Spiroplasma and Escherichia–Shigella.&lt;SEP&gt;PS-fed larvae are Tenebrio molitor larvae that were fed polystyrene (PS), leading to the detection of antioxidant additives in their frass.</data>
