  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The 32-day test is an experimental period during which larvae survival, consumption, and physiological responses to different diets were measured.&lt;SEP&gt;The 32-day test refers to the experimental period during which larvae were fed different diets and PS degradation was measured.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-92ea4ca7a83af5c086ae157fb801b326&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89344d5b5d9debdca45ab8c7c963a585</data>
