<node id="TGA Analysis">
  <data key="d0">TGA Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">TGA analysis was used to detect thermal modifications of polystyrene ingested by Tenebrio molitor larvae, showing differences in decomposition stages compared to control polystyrene foam.&lt;SEP&gt;TGA analysis was used to confirm biodegradation and oxidation of EPS and LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;TGA (Thermogravimetric Analysis) is a method used to measure weight loss and decomposition stages of PS and CS samples.&lt;SEP&gt;TGA analysis was used to detect thermal modifications of ingested PS in frass samples.</data>
