<node id="Woods Institute for Environment at Stanford University">
  <data key="d0">Woods Institute for Environment at Stanford University</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Woods Institute for Environment at Stanford University is an academic institute dedicated to advancing environmental research and solutions. In the context of the described research, the Woods Institute played a significant role as a funding and supporting body. It provided financial and institutional support that enabled the progress of the study, including direct support for Dr. W.-M. Wu. This support was formalized in part through award number 1197667-10-WTAZB, which is specifically cited as contributing to the research effort. The institute’s involvement is noted as both partial and direct funding assistance, underscoring its role in facilitating the research activities. Overall, the Woods Institute for Environment at Stanford University is recognized as a key supporter of the project, providing essential resources and funding that contributed to the successful execution of the work.&lt;SEP&gt;The Woods Institute for Environment at Stanford University provided support for the research (Award 1197667-10-WTAZB).&lt;SEP&gt;This institute supported Dr. W.-M. Wu with funding.&lt;SEP&gt;The Woods Institute for Environment at Stanford University provided financial support to Dr. W.-M. Wu (Award 1197667-10-WTAZB).&lt;SEP&gt;An institute at Stanford University that provided financial support for the research.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7106a16c81492914e4ba58e248689714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf54b3c2c01c935a178261a31b8ed897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39598f698094d1663ca3438bc143bc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27c93b39534612a0492f52ce1f3cd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5dc0ba5d8a1abfb746af0dedb7d575b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5338aa2127367c868a3e7331e1f66225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ba7d6b1b5275089cbabe56bc33b92e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1684575ed5f73a2ebe1adc7fbbb3b942</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
