<node id="Plastics Europe">
  <data key="d0">Plastics Europe</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastics Europe is an industry organization recognized for its role in providing authoritative data and analysis on plastics production, demand, usage, and waste management in Europe. It is best known for publishing the recurring report series *“Plastics – the Facts”*, which serves as a key reference for researchers, policymakers, and stakeholders in the plastics sector. These reports, released in multiple editions including 2014/2015, 2019, 2020, and 2022, compile and present comprehensive statistical information and insights on the European plastics industry. The content typically covers trends in production volumes, patterns of demand across different sectors, and data on waste generation, recycling, and recovery.  

Through *“Plastics – the Facts”*, Plastics Europe provides a consolidated knowledge base that supports understanding of the role of plastics in the European economy and their environmental implications. The reports are frequently cited in academic studies, policy analyses, and industry assessments as a reliable source of quantitative data. By publishing these resources, Plastics Europe contributes to informed decision-making and dialogue around the sustainable management of plastics, highlighting both the material’s economic importance and the challenges associated with its lifecycle.  

In summary, Plastics Europe is a central organization in the European plastics sector, widely referenced for its publication of *“Plastics – the Facts”*, a series of reports that deliver essential data and insights on plastics production, consumption, and waste in Europe.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastics Europe is cited as a source of data on global plastic production and polymer demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastics Europe is referenced as the source of 'Plastics-The facts, 2021,' a report providing information about plastics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f5613b129e38cb777855c04f228fe7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf626f7d7f62d0cee4a0e5efafeb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdeaa1a437ba819412de45788aa119c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001e8f54368c9a236f702fd09cddf4a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d76783f53d38e8c7423dff747f0413d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-767a2e5a2bde762f9c1b3dbbf7746d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22e4b8000531766cffd145ef32353af2</data>
