  <data key="d2">Wu, W. M. is an author of studies on biodegradation of plastics by worms and microorganisms.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu, W. M. is an author of a study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu, W. M. is an author of a referenced study on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu, W. M. is an author of studies on microplastics pollution, reduction strategies, and biodegradation of plastics in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of a 2014 study on polyethylene biodegradation by bacterial strains from waxworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Description not available in text.</data>
