<node id="Petroleum-based synthetic plastics">
  <data key="d0">Petroleum-based synthetic plastics</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Petroleum-based synthetic plastics include polystyrene (PS), polyethylene (PE), polypropylene (PP), polyurethane (PUR), polyvinyl chloride (PVC), and polyethylene terephthalate (PET), which are resistant to biodegradation.</data>
