<node id="PS Biodegradation">
  <data key="d0">PS Biodegradation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PS biodegradation refers to the process of mealworms consuming and breaking down polystyrene (PS) foam.&lt;SEP&gt;PS biodegradation refers to the process of breaking down polystyrene, associated with enzymatic activity and higher survival rates in insects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d616d4c3c3199d53c1ae93ebcf3589d</data>
