  <data key="d0">United Kingdom</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">The United Kingdom was one of the countries where mealworms were sourced for the study.&lt;SEP&gt;The United Kingdom is the country where Oxford University Press is located.&lt;SEP&gt;The United Kingdom is one of the locations where biodegradation of commercial PS foams by mealworms was observed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-67028993c2650049216602d03fb3f786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e540abd667582c77f4d2222836147ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e</data>
