<node id="Fourier Transform Infrared (FTIR) Spectroscopy">
  <data key="d0">Fourier Transform Infrared (FTIR) Spectroscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">FTIR spectroscopy was used to analyze frass residues to identify chemical modifications from PS digestion.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR spectroscopy is a technique used to characterize chemical modifications of polymer structures and monitor oxidized functional groups in residual PE polymers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6afbb58ebe9108893daf7e65d59fac39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e</data>
