  <data key="d0">FTIR Analyses</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">FTIR analyses were used to verify the formation of new functional groups in frass, showing chemical changes linked to plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR analyses were conducted to show the formation of newly oxidative functional groups during the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;FTIR analyses were conducted on mealworm fecula samples to detect chemical changes indicating EPS biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-069f8447676509ffdd0028e9c05fb9ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c818a01113d8c07554629cc5edfd28f9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
