  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nitrospira defluvii is one of the most abundant bacteria in Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrospira defluvii is a bacterial species previously reported in T. molitor fed with PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrospira defluvii is a bacterial species reported as abundant in mealworms fed with PS in previous studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrospira defluvii is a bacterial species associated with PS-fed gut microbiomes.</data>
