  <data key="d2">Propionibacterium is a bacterial genus found in Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Propionibacterium is a bacterial genus previously reported in T. molitor fed with PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Propionibacterium is a bacterial genus reported as abundant in mealworm gut microbiomes in some studies.</data>
