  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Haemophilus is a bacterial genus found in Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Haemophilus is a bacterial genus previously reported in T. molitor fed with PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Haemophilus is a bacterial genus reported in the gut microbiome of mealworms in some studies.</data>
