  <data key="d0">Staphylococcus</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Staphylococcus is a bacterial genus found in Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Staphylococcus is a bacterial genus previously reported in T. molitor fed with PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Staphylococcus is a bacterial genus reported in the gut microbiome of mealworms in some studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A bacterial genus enriched in CS-fed larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Staphylococcus is a bacterial genus significantly associated with gut microbiome assembly.</data>
