  <data key="d0">VC12O (Vinylcatechol 1,2-dioxygenase)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">VC12O is an enzyme that breaks down 3-vinylcatechol via meta-cleavage into 2-vinyl-cis,cis-muconic acid.</data>
