<node id="Galleria Mellonella">
  <data key="d0">Galleria Mellonella</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Galleria Mellonella, also known as the greater wax moth, is referenced as larvae capable of biodegrading polyethylene and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Wax moth caterpillars studied for their ability to biodegrade polyethylene.&lt;SEP&gt;Galleria Mellonella, also known as the greater wax moth, is studied for its larvae's ability to biodegrade plastics such as polyethylene and polystyrene.</data>
