<node id="European Commission">
  <data key="d0">European Commission</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Commission issued Commission Regulation (EU) No 10/2011 in Brussels, Belgium.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission presented a plan to reduce plastic waste, including allowing only reusable or recyclable plastic on the market and recycling at least half of the plastic produced.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission published the Weekly Oil Bulletin in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission is referenced in relation to regulations on food contact materials (FCM) and antioxidant additives such as Irgafos 168.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission provides information on construction and demolition waste management.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission is mentioned in relation to sustainability goals and environmental impact reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission is mentioned as defining goals for achieving net zero environmental impact by 2030.</data>
