  <data key="d2">Video S1 is a recorded video showing the experimental process, including the handling of pupae and adult beetles.&lt;SEP&gt;Video S1 is a time-lapse movie showing the experimental setup and plastic utilization process, including weighing of plastic pieces.&lt;SEP&gt;Video S1 documented the early appearance of pupae during the experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Video S1 is a supplementary material showing the early appearance of pupae during the experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;Video S1 is a time-lapse movie documenting the process of plastic waste entomoremediation by Tenebrio molitor.</data>
