<node id="PU1">
  <data key="d0">PU1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PU1 refers to one type of plastic tested in the experiment for consumption by T. molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;PU1 refers to a polyurethane kitchen sponge sample. It was characterized by high concentrations of Ca (10.110 ± 0.301%), Al (0.437 ± 0.038%), Si (0.358 ± 0.027%), and Cl (0.224 ± 0.022%).&lt;SEP&gt;PU1 refers to a polyurethane foam sample used in the experiment. Initially flat and smooth, it became significantly wrinkled after digestion by insects.&lt;SEP&gt;PU1 is a specific type of polyurethane tested in the experiment for plastic consumption by mealworm larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;PU1 is a specific polyurethane plastic tested in the biodegradation experiment, where pupae appeared after 10 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-065b846c5f5f23f64023995cdb21c3db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d7ae4d155085781614411da5564816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78cd8d4684fa9e0519635dba9f124a08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756373819</data>
</node>
<node id="PU2">
  <data key="d0">PU2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PU2 refers to one type of plastic tested in the experiment for consumption by T. molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;PU2 is the second investigated polyurethane material. It had high content of Cl (7.574 ± 0.141%) and P (1.379 ± 0.035%), with different elemental composition compared to PU1.&lt;SEP&gt;PU2 refers to another polyurethane foam sample used in the experiment. Initially with many edges, it became smoother and wrinkled after digestion by insects.&lt;SEP&gt;PU2 is a specific type of polyurethane tested in the experiment for plastic consumption by mealworm larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;PU2 refers to a polyurethane sample with higher concentrations of Cl and P, used in experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;PU2 is another polyurethane plastic tested in the biodegradation experiment, with a mass reduction efficiency of 53.2%.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4b03ca32b0efbf0ca6a3c8761c0d03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-119b3f144b4ec234392cca17031bd7a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-065b846c5f5f23f64023995cdb21c3db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d7ae4d155085781614411da5564816&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78cd8d4684fa9e0519635dba9f124a08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756373819</data>
</node>
