<node id="Wilcox, C.">
  <data key="d0">Wilcox, C.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wilcox, C. is a researcher recognized as one of the authors of the influential article *“Plastic waste inputs from land into the ocean,”* published in the journal *Science* in 2015. This study, co-authored with other leading scientists, provided a groundbreaking assessment of the scale and pathways through which plastic waste generated on land enters marine environments. The research quantified global plastic waste inputs, highlighted the significant contribution of mismanaged waste to ocean pollution, and underscored the urgent environmental challenges posed by plastic debris in marine ecosystems. Wilcox, C.’s contribution to this work situates them within a key body of scholarship that has shaped scientific and policy discussions on plastic pollution, waste management, and ocean conservation.&lt;SEP&gt;Wilcox, C. is an author of a referenced study on plastic waste inputs from land into the ocean.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bb7b0638c9c59e134df0491b542efdf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c07a838ff0a489c73c8319e5011134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02a8ea5e75c58dcb9cfbbcd64f37d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463ac9dfa68274d35700c61208f4ea85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1684575ed5f73a2ebe1adc7fbbb3b942</data>
