  <data key="d0">Hylocereus undatus</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Hylocereus undatus, also known as dragon fruit cactus, was used in grafting experiments to test the effects of worm frass and tea leaves on plant growth.</data>
