  <data key="d0">Zero-Waste Circular Economy</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The study suggests that superworms could contribute to a zero-waste circular economy by consuming PS and producing useful frass.&lt;SEP&gt;The zero-waste circular economy is a sustainability concept discussed in the study, where worms are used to degrade plastic waste and their frass supports plant growth, addressing food production and plastic waste challenges.</data>
