<node id="Science">
  <data key="d0">Science</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">**Science** is a leading peer‑reviewed scientific journal recognized for its global influence in disseminating high‑impact research across a wide range of disciplines. Established as one of the world’s most prestigious academic journals, *Science* has consistently served as a platform for groundbreaking studies that shape scientific inquiry, inform policy, and contribute to public understanding of critical issues.  

The journal has played a particularly prominent role in advancing knowledge of environmental challenges, especially those related to plastic pollution and human impacts on marine ecosystems. Among its most influential contributions is the 2015 study by Jambeck, Geyer, and colleagues, which provided the first comprehensive global estimate of plastic waste entering the oceans from land. This publication significantly influenced both scientific research agendas and international policy discussions on marine plastic pollution. *Science* also published a 2008 landmark assessment of global human impacts on marine ecosystems, systematically documenting anthropogenic pressures and ecological degradation worldwide. Additional studies featured in the journal include research on plastic accumulation in the North Atlantic subtropical gyre and investigations into the role of plastic waste in coral reef disease, both of which deepened understanding of the distribution and ecological consequences of plastic pollution.  

In the field of environmental microbiology, *Science* published the 2016 discovery of a bacterium capable of degrading and assimilating poly(ethylene terephthalate) (PET), a widely used plastic. This finding marked a major step forward in exploring biological solutions to plastic waste. Beyond environmental research, the journal has also been a venue for important biomedical studies. Notable examples include metagenomic analyses of the human distal gut microbiome, which advanced understanding of microbial diversity and host‑microbe interactions, and research on host‑bacterial mutualism in the human intestine, which provided insights into the complex relationships between humans and their microbiota.  

*Science* has also contributed to urgent public health discourse, publishing studies such as research on the effectiveness of face masks in limiting the transmission of SARS‑CoV‑2 during the COVID‑19 pandemic. By providing a platform for such timely and impactful work, the journal has reinforced its role as a central forum for addressing pressing global challenges.  

Through its publication of pioneering studies spanning environmental sustainability, human health, and beyond, **Science** has established itself as a premier outlet for transformative research. Its enduring influence lies not only in advancing scientific knowledge but also in shaping policy, guiding societal responses to global issues, and fostering interdisciplinary dialogue within the scientific community and the broader public.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is the journal where the 2016 study on a bacterium that degrades PET was published.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is the journal in which the referenced article was published.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is the journal where nitrogen fixation in termites was reported.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a scientific journal where Breznak JA published research on nitrogen fixation.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a scientific journal where research on symbiotic nitrogen fixation in leaf-cutter ants was published.&lt;SEP&gt;Science is a scientific journal that published a 2021 report on the surge in ocean plastic studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f99668e767a56e2e64ece791653b952&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866df96ed7f051acf60ebd0e82d9a19e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825c2784fa66ce67114e4173ed0702f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e38968f22c4cd9bef3f1562e4ca47e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40407fe311340b08da856202f38b459c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc31a0931fceb1446bc6ec4d0c587f7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e478d12101aa862a23f9dfc7ac8896b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908b8bfa7e446694958cf9bd0cfbc583&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa10245aaff722ac7d69e73bed8afe74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-933de951613fc7eadfd14dde9bd18b2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a24fcfbc571e8620a1fc59b215b42e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecf2c478d08c7bc8e491f630aa289881&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463ac9dfa68274d35700c61208f4ea85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bce368b44455642f4b9a1dacc4cdf0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1dd9a0647afad70038c8052c24eb5a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4da90774e2e5cb1fea30fd5aa390760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02a8ea5e75c58dcb9cfbbcd64f37d82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fa884bb7540491e8ab975e29c46d1f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827853316f7304c444884dc82f757802&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d7f6907ee7ce47b00537b1458fcc029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56af93e805daf3987d95ff99ab8e891d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582</data>
