  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The TCA cycle is a metabolic pathway into which phenylacetyl-CoA enters during microbial decomposition of styrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The TCA cycle is a metabolic pathway regulated by Mg²⁺ and involved in cellular energy production.</data>
