<node id="Plastic World">
  <data key="d0">Plastic World</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastic World refers to the widespread littering of plastics across continents, oceans, and the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic World is described as a global condition where plastics dominate across continents, oceans, and every corner of the world.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a</data>
