</node>
<node id="Activated Sludge">
  <data key="d0">Activated Sludge</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Activated sludge is one of the microbial sources evaluated for polystyrene biodegradation since the 1970s.&lt;SEP&gt;Activated sludge was used in biodegradation experiments, showing limited release of CO2 from polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7432cb0d6c74fd2dd80b065fbad26b4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a</data>
