</node>
<node id="Trash">
  <data key="d0">Trash</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Trash is mentioned as one of the sources of microbial cultures tested for polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Trash was included as a microbial community in biodegradation studies of polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7432cb0d6c74fd2dd80b065fbad26b4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a</data>
