  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Manure is listed as a source of microbial cultures evaluated for polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Manure is a microbial environment where polystyrene biodegradation has been tested, showing low degradation rates.</data>
