<node id="Soil Contamination">
  <data key="d0">Soil Contamination</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Soil contamination occurs due to plastic waste disposal, leading to pollution, decline in crop production, and chemical leaching into soil and groundwater.</data>
