  <data key="d0">Xanthobacter sp. strain 124X</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Xanthobacter sp. strain 124X is a styrene-degrading bacterium isolated from sewage culture.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7432cb0d6c74fd2dd80b065fbad26b4b</data>
