<node id="Rhodococcus ruber C208">
  <data key="d0">Rhodococcus ruber C208</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A bacterial strain studied for PS biodegradation, reported by Mor &amp; Sivan.&lt;SEP&gt;Rhodococcus ruber C208 is a bacterium that removed 4% of branched LDPE films pretreated with UV irradiation after 30 days.&lt;SEP&gt;Rhodococcus ruber C208 is a bacterial strain that degraded PS by 0.8% over 56 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfcb17715cb4e5148b33061c1b6cbf1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4c8c66bfbbfc37ed842f53d2b8796c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9972450967f344c19cb747d7ce649e</data>
