  <data key="d0">Harbin, China</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Location where mealworms were tested for Styrofoam biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Harbin, China is one of the locations where Styrofoam-degrading mealworms were studied.&lt;SEP&gt;Harbin is a city in China where T. molitor larvae were procured from the Dafa Birds and Flower Market.&lt;SEP&gt;Location where wheat bran was purchased from a farm.&lt;SEP&gt;Harbin, China is the location of Harbin Institute of Technology.</data>
