  <data key="d2">Location where mealworms were tested for Styrofoam biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Compton, California, USA is one of the locations where Styrofoam-degrading mealworms were studied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d3b3c7bbc61318a9728caff13ac5b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4c8c66bfbbfc37ed842f53d2b8796c</data>
