<node id="Hydroquinone Peroxidase">
  <data key="d0">Hydroquinone Peroxidase</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An enzyme produced by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM21 that was reported to degrade polystyrene in a dichloromethane-water system.&lt;SEP&gt;An enzyme from Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 studied for its ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroquinone peroxidase is an enzyme secreted by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 that degrades polystyrene (PS).&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroquinone Peroxidase is an enzyme produced by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 that can degrade polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b4b45d826a6a7956015e680f5fb8ee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-effe1e87d51e126ff4ec5cf9e49d6524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4c8c66bfbbfc37ed842f53d2b8796c</data>
