<node id="Wu W M">
  <data key="d0">Wu W M</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wu W M is an author cited in the references for research on microplastics pollution and reduction strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu W M is an author of a 2017 study on microplastics pollution and reduction strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu W M co-authored research on biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu W M is listed as one of the authors of the study on biodegradation of polystyrene wastes in yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Co-author of multiple referenced studies on biodegradation of plastics by mealworms and waxworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d3b3c7bbc61318a9728caff13ac5b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39598f698094d1663ca3438bc143bc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71372e333b39cee7eea0c53f89bec5c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503c588468d284ba03a34235957f9b02</data>
