  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang and colleagues isolated a PE- and PS-degrading bacterial strain from Indian meal moth.&lt;SEP&gt;Yang et al. (2014) discovered that bacteria isolated from the gut of waxworms can degrade LDPE, though at lower rates than reported by Bombelli et al. (2017).&lt;SEP&gt;Yang et al. (2014) are cited researchers who studied insect gut microbiota and its role in plastic degradation.</data>
