  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Przemieniecki and colleagues reported microbial community shifts in T. molitor fed cellulose, PE, and PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Researchers who conducted a previous study referenced in this text.&lt;SEP&gt;Przemieniecki et al. are cited researchers whose previous work noted a high proportion of Planctomycetes in the PS variant.</data>
