  <data key="d0">Galleria mellonella (Waxworm)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Galleria mellonella, also known as waxworm, is another insect species studied for its ability to metabolize polyethylene and contribute to plastic biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
