<node id="Antibiotics">
  <data key="d0">Antibiotics</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Antibiotics were used to suppress the gut microbiome of mealworms in experiments, demonstrating the microbiome’s role in polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibiotics were used in treatment to test whether inhibition of activity was due to residual antibiotics.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibiotics were supplemented with the diet of larvae at a specific ratio and dosage to study their effects on gut bacteria and metabolism.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of six antibiotics tested for their ability to inhibit gut bacteria in mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68041096d198a27b4ed526281746b7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668212da3bf356132cadb63df6ce09b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20395efa1299dc8b777774e765ad1159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756380694</data>
</node>
<node id="Salivary Glands Proteins">
  <data key="d0">Salivary Glands Proteins</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Proteins secreted by the salivary glands of insects, which undergo significant changes during plastic degradation, indicating their role in the process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756375008</data>
</node>
<node id="Microbial Enrichments">
  <data key="d0">Microbial Enrichments</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Microbial enrichments are cultivated communities derived from the gut microbiome that were enhanced outside the insect gut to increase plastic biodegradation rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756375008</data>
</node>
<node id="Cradle-to-Grave Lifecycle">
  <data key="d0">Cradle-to-Grave Lifecycle</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The cradle-to-grave lifecycle refers to the current linear lifecycle of plastics, which results in accumulation in landfills and the environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5</data>
