<node id="Carbon-Free Media">
  <data key="d0">Carbon-Free Media</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon-free media was used to culture the gut microbiome from PS-fed mealworms with PS microplastics, ensuring no external carbon source was present.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon-free media was used in serum bottle experiments as a growth medium for microbial cultures with PS microplastics as the sole carbon source.&lt;SEP&gt;Growth medium without carbon sources, supplemented with PS films and gut supernatant to test bacterial respiration and biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eda80cb027c8107defa00011d491b002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-668212da3bf356132cadb63df6ce09b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-902ed6a67c601276c5dbf43c35dd824f</data>
