  <data key="d0">Figure 1a</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 1a presents experimental results showing respiration activity increases in the lowest molecular weight fraction and differences between PS and bran supernatants.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 1a shows ESEM observations of bacterial morphotypes in the midgut of Styrofoam-eating mealworms.</data>
