  <data key="d0">PS Degradation</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">PS degradation was measured by percent CO2 production, indicating the breakdown of PS by the gut microbiome and cultured enrichment.&lt;SEP&gt;PS degradation refers to the breakdown of polystyrene by larvae, influenced by both host enzymes and gut microbiota, and measured through molecular weight reduction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c84ac252cb9ce906354bda2ad1113aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-902ed6a67c601276c5dbf43c35dd824f</data>
