  <data key="d0">Cultured Enrichment</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Cultured enrichment refers to laboratory-grown microbial cultures derived from the mealworm gut microbiome, tested for PS degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cultured enrichment refers to laboratory-grown microbial communities used to study PS degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eda80cb027c8107defa00011d491b002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-902ed6a67c601276c5dbf43c35dd824f</data>
