  <data key="d0">PBSA</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PBSA (Bionolle 3020MD) is a type of bioplastic pellet used in the experiment, supplied by Showa Denko K.K.&lt;SEP&gt;PBSA refers to poly(butylene succinate-co-adipate), one of the plastics used in emulsion preparation and microbial degradation tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-96c2e7d253d2108b0ed94be7f2dc7466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326aabc25dd967951a7845ea221532ac</data>
