  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PCL is a type of bioplastic pellet used in the experiment, supplied by TRESNO.&lt;SEP&gt;PCL refers to polycaprolactone, one of the plastics used in emulsion preparation and microbial degradation tests.&lt;SEP&gt;Polycaprolactone, a biodegradable polymer used in the bacterial biodegradation experiment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41635122b30ee45048cc885b38fff6ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96c2e7d253d2108b0ed94be7f2dc7466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-326aabc25dd967951a7845ea221532ac</data>
