<node id="Triglyceride">
  <data key="d0">Triglyceride</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Triglyceride is the stored form of fatty acids in insects, serving as the main energy source during malnutrition.&lt;SEP&gt;Triglyceride is the stored form of fatty acids in insects, consumed during starvation as an energy source.&lt;SEP&gt;Triglyceride levels in insects are connected with the duration of starvation periods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-14f9f0280098bb86719394a4bd53e5bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2281f98bcfd555a703fd86232dfa42fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc88563632a3abf926bf4e4ac16973fb</data>
