  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Renault et al. (2002) conducted studies on starvation in insects, including Alphitobius diaperinus, and reported on lipid, carbohydrate, and protein metabolism.&lt;SEP&gt;Renault et al. (2002) refers to a research study cited in the text that investigated triglyceride levels and energy metabolism in insects.</data>
