  <data key="d3">chunk-779ca6b59945309c6bf5040c9fb474ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4af956dbe737dee68ab6b9834fe2fcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc6c2706bd609f920aa61d5ef2310db6</data>
  <data key="d2">Mice exposed to polystyrene microplastics showed altered gut microflora gene expression, especially in fat and lipid metabolism.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene microplastics are pollutants studied for their gut toxicity effects on Eisenia fetida and their biodegradation in organisms such as Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of plastic studied for complete digestion/biodegradation by greater wax moth larvae.</data>
