  <data key="d2">OD600 is a measurement of optical density at 600 nm used to monitor bacterial growth phase before mixing strains.&lt;SEP&gt;OD600 is the optical density measurement at 600 nm used to monitor bacterial growth in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;OD600 refers to optical density at 600 nm, used to measure bacterial growth curves and turbidity changes in the experiments.</data>
