  <data key="d0">Molecular Weight Parameters (Mn, Mw, Mz)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Molecular weight parameters Mn, Mw, and Mz were measured to assess changes in PE mulching films treated with bacterial strains.</data>
