  <data key="d0">LB Medium</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">LB medium was used to culture strains NyZ450 and NyZ451 overnight before washing and transferring them into LCFBM.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a nutrient medium used for culturing strain PELW2042 to study its growth conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium was used as a growth medium for spreading gut suspension and bacterial enrichment cultures.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a nutrient-rich growth medium used for culturing bacteria in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium was used as a nutrient medium for culturing bacterial strains during growth and degradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a nutrient medium used to observe bacterial growth curves.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is the growth medium in which bacterial doubling times were measured.</data>
