<node id="Bombelli et al. (2017)">
  <data key="d0">Bombelli et al. (2017)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Bombelli et al. reported accelerated biodegradation of polyethylene by larvae of the greater wax moth.&lt;SEP&gt;Bombelli et al. (2017) conducted research on biochemical recycling pathways, specifically on polyethylene degradation, but their results were later questioned for methodological issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Bombelli et al. (2017) conducted experiments involving homogenate paste and polyethylene degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Bombelli et al. (2017) is a referenced study that reported significant LDPE degradation using homogenate paste of greater wax moth larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Bombelli et al. (2017) reported earlier findings suggesting rapid degradation of LDPE by wax moth larvae or homogenate paste.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681ece0a8beca8b22f3c6aa11a564f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a6f770f1d3a35f8611c5f2516c1e08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff933f404b1e6da13d6c1319bc7432c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a214d2b1c90aeb78e6e8562679d4963</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756375860</data>
</node>
<node id="Weber et al. (2017)">
  <data key="d0">Weber et al. (2017)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Weber et al. published correspondence pointing out doubts about the results of Bombelli et al. (2017).&lt;SEP&gt;Weber et al. (2017) published a correspondence pointing out methodological issues in Bombelli et al.'s work, questioning the validity of their findings.&lt;SEP&gt;Weber et al. (2017) suggested that mechanical tearing of LDPE substrates could occur in homogenate experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Weber et al. (2017) is a referenced study suggesting that observed LDPE mass loss may be due to mechanical wear rather than true biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Weber et al. (2017) suggested that earlier observed mass losses of LDPE might be due to mechanical wear rather than actual biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681ece0a8beca8b22f3c6aa11a564f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98a6f770f1d3a35f8611c5f2516c1e08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff933f404b1e6da13d6c1319bc7432c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a214d2b1c90aeb78e6e8562679d4963</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756375860</data>
</node>
