  <data key="d0">Biochemical recycling technologies</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Technologies aimed at recycling plastics through biochemical processes, potentially inspired by biodegradation research.&lt;SEP&gt;Biochemical recycling technologies refer to methods of converting polymers like polyethylene into useful chemicals such as ethylene glycol.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff933f404b1e6da13d6c1319bc7432c7</data>
