<node id="Life cycle assessment (LCA)">
  <data key="d0">Life cycle assessment (LCA)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A method used in the study to evaluate the environmental impacts of biodegradation approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;Life cycle assessment (LCA) is a method used in the study to evaluate environmental and economic impacts of scaling biodegradation processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff933f404b1e6da13d6c1319bc7432c7</data>
