  <data key="d0">Techno-economic analysis (TEA)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A method used in the study to evaluate the economic feasibility of biodegradation approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;Techno-economic analysis (TEA) is a method used in the study to project environmental and economic metrics for scaling waste management processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff933f404b1e6da13d6c1319bc7432c7</data>
