  <data key="d0">LDPE Film</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Low-density polyethylene film used in experiments with greater wax moth larvae to measure plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Low-density polyethylene (LDPE) film was the substrate material tested for degradation by greater wax moth larvae and mealworms. Mass loss and hole formation were observed in several experiments.</data>
