  <data key="d0">Biodiesel</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Biodiesel is produced from the lipid content of mealworms at end-of-life as a co-product of the plastic waste treatment process.&lt;SEP&gt;Biodiesel is a potential product derived from lipids in larvae, though larvae fed only on plastics do not gain mass, limiting biodiesel yield.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8624d79db8ed1c4488f890a1d0c085a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6d515521d6d2b72e82154cc544d26cc</data>
