  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">High-density polyethylene is a type of plastic that mealworms biodegrade less effectively compared to low-density polyethylene.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of plastic studied for colonization and degradation by Aspergillus niger.</data>
