<node id="Mealworm (Tenebrio molitor)">
  <data key="d0">Mealworm (Tenebrio molitor)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mealworm, the larva of Tenebrio molitor, was previously reported to degrade and mineralize Styrofoam.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworm, specifically Tenebrio molitor, is mentioned as having the ability to degrade HDPE. In experiments, exposure of HDPE film to ~300 Tenebrio molitor for one week and one month resulted in significant mass loss, indicating biodegradation capability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4304c39ef3427872131caf77e7cdb438&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-361c5d4ba2e879627f4eb7fc4011ee3b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756376357</data>
</node>
