<node id="Mandibulate Insects">
  <data key="d0">Mandibulate Insects</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mandibulate insects are reported to chew and eat plastic packages, including polyvinyl chloride (PVC).&lt;SEP&gt;Mandibulate insects are reported to chew and eat plastic packages, including PVC, PE, and PP films.&lt;SEP&gt;Mandibulate insects are capable of chewing and eating plastic packages of grain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4443da1fe36ec7133cd5add18d1957a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fa795762aa89809d8221dc9dda92fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a</data>
