  <data key="d2">Global plastic consumption was approximately 299 Mt/year, with polystyrene accounting for 21 Mt/year in 2013.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7fa795762aa89809d8221dc9dda92fa</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
