<node id="Plastic-Eating Insects">
  <data key="d0">Plastic-Eating Insects</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastic-eating insects are insects capable of ingesting plastic, though it was previously unclear if they could biodegrade it in their gut.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756376874</data>
