  <data key="d0">GC-TOF-MS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Gas Chromatography Time-of-Flight Mass Spectrometry (GC-TOF-MS) is an analytical technique used in the study to evaluate metabolic profiling of mealworm larvae and frass.&lt;SEP&gt;Gas chromatography time-of-flight mass spectrometry used to analyze frass extracts.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical technique used for metabolic profiling in studies of expanded polystyrene biodegradation by mealworms.</data>
