<node id="Metabolomics">
  <data key="d0">Metabolomics</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Metabolomics is the analysis of metabolites, applied in this study to investigate gut tissue and frass during polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolomics is the scientific approach used in the study to analyze central carbon metabolism metabolites in insects exposed to plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolomics is the scientific approach used to analyze central carbon metabolism (CCM) metabolites and study insect responses to plastic exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolomics was used as an analytical approach in the study on polybrominated diphenyl ether-47 and breast cancer mice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e25fe1af3bede4605e7b94d457c9634&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c8dab62f56f2bfabf08bfe99049386a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8e18d03240e025c60621d616f1de85b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b</data>
