  <data key="d2">Cholesterol is a metabolite detected in larvae tissue analysis, higher in Diet 2 with bran:PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Cholesterol is a metabolite that was higher in Diets 2 and 3 with increased bran:PS ratio.</data>
