<node id="Mannose">
  <data key="d0">Mannose</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mannose is a monosaccharide important for protein glycosylation in mammals, but considered a non-efficient cellular energy source.&lt;SEP&gt;Mannose is an important monosaccharide involved in protein glycosylation in mammals, considered a non-efficient cellular energy source, and can be converted into glucose during catabolism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e4030ea35bee29093c1a8f19bc90774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d616d4c3c3199d53c1ae93ebcf3589d</data>
