<node id="Protein Glycosylation">
  <data key="d0">Protein Glycosylation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Protein glycosylation is a post-translational modification of proteins, involving mannose, and is highly regulated in cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein glycosylation is a post-translational modification of proteins, important for secondary protein synthesis within cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2e4030ea35bee29093c1a8f19bc90774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d616d4c3c3199d53c1ae93ebcf3589d</data>
