  <data key="d2">Nathalia A. López-Ramírez is one of the authors of the study on Tenebrio molitor and its gut bacteria growth in polystyrene presence as the sole carbon source.&lt;SEP&gt;Nathalia A. López-Ramírez is an environmental engineer with experience in Health, Safety and Environment (HSE). She has developed post-consumption programs for multinational companies and has knowledge in waste management, transport and handling of chemical substances, and continuous improvement processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a54f7d9e0a43fb94e2fc35f93656fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e276f74ca596eed69175a31dab0bf51b</data>
