  <data key="d0">Colombia</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Colombia is mentioned as a country where polystyrene is produced at a capacity of 110,000 tons per year.&lt;SEP&gt;Colombia is the country referenced in the publication 'Plásticos en Colombia' by Acoplásticos.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c4804d2c00d1d5fff2b89eaf6da26da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a54f7d9e0a43fb94e2fc35f93656fc9</data>
