<node id="T. molitor adults">
  <data key="d0">T. molitor adults</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adult T. molitor beetles were tested for their ability to ingest polystyrene plates.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor adults were tested for their ability to consume PS plates but showed no significant changes in the plates after 15 days, suggesting they cannot feed on PS due to jaw structure changes or microbiota differences.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor adults are organisms that may not be able to ingest PS due to structural changes in their jaws and possible changes in intestinal microbiota composition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39c4ff9e5812f88117b37503a70b0479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5318125e74217718b470b7721d1d6365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c4804d2c00d1d5fff2b89eaf6da26da</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756377445</data>
</node>
