  <data key="d0">T. molitor gut bacteria</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Gut bacteria isolated from T. molitor larvae and adults were studied for their ability to grow on polystyrene as the sole carbon source.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39c4ff9e5812f88117b37503a70b0479</data>
