  <data key="d0">Stenotrophomonas</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Stenotrophomonas is a bacterial genus identified in the digestive tracts of T. molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Stenotrophomonas is a bacterial genus present in some PE-fed groups but absent in WB-fed larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Stenotrophomonas is a bacterial genus with significantly different relative abundances between diet groups in the mealworm gut microbiome study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-64e35cb810117768309e5f4db5d7e6b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5318125e74217718b470b7721d1d6365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1faf524e6fabeb512a07b13f37e51e</data>
