  <data key="d0">Wynants et al., 2017</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wynants et al., 2017 suggested that changes in intestinal microbiota composition through T. molitor life stages may explain adults’ inability to process PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Wynants et al. (2017) are cited for research on insect gut microbiota composition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2665d67f816d2da20a065d708c370210&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5318125e74217718b470b7721d1d6365</data>
