<node id="Exiguobacterium">
  <data key="d0">Exiguobacterium</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Exiguobacterium is a bacterial genus identified in a previous study as responsible for the degradation of PS in Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium is a bacterial genus identified as capable of creating biofilms and degrading polystyrene in Tenebrio molitor's gut.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2665d67f816d2da20a065d708c370210&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-001e8f54368c9a236f702fd09cddf4a8</data>
