  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Bacillus anthracis is a species of Bacillus identified among the isolates from Tenebrio molitor digestive tracts, capable of modifying PS sheets.&lt;SEP&gt;Bacillus anthracis is a bacterium mentioned in the study that formed tunnels, cracks, and cellular aggregates on PS sheets.</data>
