  <data key="d2">Erwinia persicina is a bacterial species identified among the isolates from Tenebrio molitor digestive tracts.&lt;SEP&gt;Erwinia persicina is a species of the genus Erwinia, included in phylogenetic analysis with strain BIT-26T.</data>
