  <data key="d0">Figure 7</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 7 shows microscopic images of frass obtained after EPS consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 7 presents a bar plot of the community analysis of the mealworm gut for PU and bran diets, showing phylum and genus-level distributions.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 7 proposes a multiple generational insect plastic exposure study using multi-omics approaches and plastic degradation data.</data>
