  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Oxo-degradable polyethylene, referred to as PE-oxo, was one of the polyethylene-based diets tested on mealworm larvae.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-728d6b0b96814c5c3c7b93042e9b9856</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756377807</data>
