  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Metabolism refers to the biochemical processes in larvae, analyzed for dissimilarity and clustering under different diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolism is referenced as a physiological process affected by polyethylene biodegradation in larvae.</data>
