<node id="Clostridiales">
  <data key="d0">Clostridiales</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Clostridiales is a bacterial order with an average abundance of 14.5%, higher in OAT diet and significantly lower in PE-oxo diet.&lt;SEP&gt;An order of bacteria associated with OAT and PE-reg diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Clostridiales are bacteria found in the insect gut microbiome regardless of diet.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0e30f29e9016acae216566f53e60cea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a4712059883b356b4aea23cb7ef1514&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84297b844ec01d2f58756b669806fd62</data>
