  <data key="d2">Uloma sp. is an insect species mentioned as capable of degrading plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Honey bee pest species within the darkling beetle family found to biodegrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Uloma sp. is a genus of darkling beetles confirmed to biodegrade PS plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Uloma sp. refers to a genus of beetles with plastic-degrading capacities.&lt;SEP&gt;Uloma sp. refers to a group of insect larvae mentioned as having plastic-degrading features similar to mealworms.</data>
