<node id="Host Transcriptome">
  <data key="d0">Host Transcriptome</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The transcriptome of Tenebrio molitor larvae, which showed up-regulation of digestive and bacterial enzymes after feeding on polypropylene.&lt;SEP&gt;The host transcriptome refers to the gene expression profile of the insect host, which was examined in relation to PET degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The host transcriptome refers to the gene expression profile of T. molitor larvae, which showed lipid homeostasis and oxidative stress responses during PET degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b19ac5bdc755bb8e9deb8e317ce365dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79c11bccb4ef9bd152bdae9b5c2c5c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566afea8a2a89bd188f68d0afa1bb173</data>
