  <data key="d2">The unfed group of larvae served as a control group in the experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;The unfed group refers to larvae that were not provided with any feedstock, showing the highest weight loss compared to PS-, CS-, and CB-fed groups.&lt;SEP&gt;The unfed group consisted of mealworms that were not provided with any feed.</data>
