  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mw is a molecular weight parameter of polypropylene measured before and after biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mw is a molecular weight parameter measured in PS residues, which decreased after mealworm digestion.</data>
