  <data key="d1">organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Klebsiella sp. is a bacterial genus found in PP-fed larvae and has been reported to degrade plastics. A strain, Klebsiella pneumoniae Mk-1, was isolated from soil and confirmed to degrade PE.</data>
