  <data key="d0">Cutinase</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cutinase is an enzyme found in higher abundance in PP-fed larvae, potentially involved in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cutinase is an enzyme studied for PET degradation, particularly under ambient temperatures.</data>
