<node id="Two-component system">
  <data key="d0">Two-component system</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Two-component system is a chemotaxis-related pathway enriched in PP-fed microbiota, aiding bacterial navigation and colonization.&lt;SEP&gt;Two-component system is a signaling mechanism in bacteria, associated with PE degradation in Tenebrio larvae.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0817d79fa27f2f5b078e09086250c6e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b30daa90b5c91314e1d65e87f191166</data>
