<node id="Drosophila melanogaster">
  <data key="d0">Drosophila melanogaster</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Drosophila melanogaster is a natural population of fruit flies studied for genetic variation affecting trehalose sensitivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Drosophila melanogaster is a species studied for its attraction, oviposition, and development mediated by yeast rather than fruit volatiles.</data>
