  <data key="d3">chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a81144d30653377d6d90e26c4497eb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b8c7f0b790b0289a7683fde0eca126</data>
  <data key="d2">The gut microbiome in Tenebrio larvae is associated with nitrogen metabolism during polyethylene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrogen metabolism pathways were abundant in PET27100- and PET63500-fed groups compared to the control group.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrogen metabolism pathways were stimulated in the gut microbiome of Tenebrio larvae during polyethylene degradation.</data>
