  <data key="d2">Lipases are used for synthesis and degradation of polymers.&lt;SEP&gt;The journal in which the 2021 study on biodegradation of different plastics by Tenebrio molitor was published.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymers is a journal cited in the references.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymers are materials whose physicochemical properties, such as type, hydrophobicity, molecular weight distribution, and crystallinity, impact biodegradation rates.&lt;SEP&gt;The journal in which Bulak et al. (2021) published their study on biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Polymers is the journal where the study on photostable polystyrene films was published.</data>
