<node id="Lipase">
  <data key="d0">Lipase</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An enzyme catalyzing polyurethane degradation, including Candida rugosa lipase.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipase is an enzyme that hydrolyzes products of PS and CS degradation into long-chain fatty acids.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipase is an enzyme detected in bacterial isolates, involved in breaking down lipids.</data>
