  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">PE-B treatment refers to the experimental condition where yellow mealworms were fed polyethylene, resulting in a degradation rate of 20.7%.&lt;SEP&gt;PE-B treatment refers to yellow mealworms fed with 0.5 g of polyethylene.</data>
