  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">PE-C treatment refers to the experimental condition where yellow mealworms were fed polyethylene, resulting in a reduced conversion rate of 9.00%.&lt;SEP&gt;PE-C treatment refers to yellow mealworms fed with 1 g of polyethylene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddb3edd44829125161ad624ea793ae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdb235a6eddd0a0e69be356e83362fc7</data>
