  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">PS-B treatment refers to the experimental condition where yellow mealworms were fed polystyrene, resulting in the highest degradation rate of 15.3%.&lt;SEP&gt;PS-B treatment refers to yellow mealworms fed with 0.5 g of polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddb3edd44829125161ad624ea793ae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdb235a6eddd0a0e69be356e83362fc7</data>
