  <data key="d0">PS-A Treatment</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">PS-A treatment refers to the experimental condition where yellow mealworms were fed polystyrene, resulting in a degradation rate of 13.7%.&lt;SEP&gt;PS-A treatment refers to yellow mealworms fed with 0.1 g of polystyrene, which resulted in a crude protein content of 45.7 ± 2.08%.</data>
