  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PBAT is a biodegradable polymer developed as an alternative to petroleum-based plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;PBAT is a biodegradable polymer that earthworms can fragment into smaller particles.&lt;SEP&gt;Poly(butylene adipate-co-terephthalate) (PBAT) is a petro-based plastic that mealworms can degrade and use for energy.</data>
