<node id="Plastic biofragmentation">
  <data key="d0">Plastic biofragmentation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastic biofragmentation is the process by which macroinvertebrates break plastics into smaller particles such as microplastics (MPs) and nanoplastics (NPs) through biting, chewing, and gut contraction.</data>
