  <data key="d2">MPs (microplastics) refer to small plastic particles such as PLA, PS, and PVC that were ingested by larvae, inducing negative physiological responses.&lt;SEP&gt;MPs (microplastics) are plastic particles larger than 1 μm, observed in larvae biodegradation experiments.</data>
