  <data key="d2">Crude fat is a nutrient measured in larvae, which was significantly lower in plastic-fed larvae compared to bran-fed larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude fat is a nutritional component measured in the biomass composition of T. molitor and T. obscurus larvae.</data>
