  <data key="d0">CB</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">CB was one of the feedstocks provided to larvae, both antibiotic-treated and untreated.&lt;SEP&gt;CB is a type of feed given to larvae, used as a comparison in degradation and metabolomic studies.&lt;SEP&gt;CB is another type of diet used in the study, compared with PS and CS in gene expression analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20395efa1299dc8b777774e765ad1159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e155a60beeedb5736450fdc1ffa4699e</data>
