  <data key="d2">Sugars were one of the macromolecules biochemically assessed in mealworms fed with polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Sugars are biochemical compounds measured in mealworms fed different polystyrene materials, showing significant decreases under PS and PSr diets.</data>
