  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Incineration is one of the methods used for disposal of waste plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Incineration is a traditional disposal method for plastic waste, contributing to environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Incineration is a method of eliminating Styrofoam waste, requiring high temperatures and energy for proper combustion.&lt;SEP&gt;Incineration is a traditional method of disposing of waste plastic, but it cannot fundamentally solve environmental pollution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06a44b308af148551c5b7feef324d88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafca19c0156f11127587dba3673503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91ffc7c76e8e0a1757d91f7cf62f568</data>
