  <data key="d2">PET100 is a low molecular weight PET polymer used in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;PET100 is one of the PET-fed groups used in the metagenome sequencing analysis, showing more efficient PET degradation due to lower molecular weight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79c11bccb4ef9bd152bdae9b5c2c5c8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b8c7f0b790b0289a7683fde0eca126</data>
