  <data key="d0">PET_100</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PET_100 is a low molecular weight PET polymer used in the biodegradation study. It was irregularly shaped solid bulk material and ground to less than 75 μm before use.&lt;SEP&gt;PET_100 is a high purity PET-agar gel with a molecular weight of 100, consumed by larvae in 13 days.</data>
