  <data key="d2">PET_2700 is a medium molecular weight PET polymer used in the biodegradation study. It was fine powder with a size of around 60 μm.&lt;SEP&gt;PET_2700 is a high purity PET-agar gel with a molecular weight of 2700, consumed by larvae in 15 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5a7fb8d6a76ecfbfc810f952bfba090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c426315f0f412528b9c6fb2a82dff2c</data>
