<node id="Antibiotic suppression test">
  <data key="d0">Antibiotic suppression test</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">This event refers to the experimental test designed to examine the contribution of gut microbiota in PET degradation by suppressing gut microbes with antibiotics.&lt;SEP&gt;An experiment performed to examine the role of gut microbes in PP depolymerization/biodegradation in larvae using gentamicin.&lt;SEP&gt;The antibiotic suppression test was conducted to examine the role of gut microbes in PP biodegradation in larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;An experiment conducted to test the effect of antibiotics on PE depolymerization and biodegradation in larvae.</data>
