  <data key="d2">Erythromycin is one of the antibiotics used in the suppression test.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythromycin is one of the antibiotics used in the suppression treatment assay.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythromycin is one of the six antibiotics tested for its ability to inhibit mealworm gut bacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythromycin is one of the antibiotics tested for its ability to inhibit gut bacteria in larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Erythromycin is an antibiotic tested in inhibition halo tests on larval gut microbes.</data>
