  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Stable carbon isotope (δ13C) analysis was used to confirm PET biodegradation by detecting enrichment of 13C in residual PET extracted from larval frass.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a88f3ed3eec20cee61421cc094dde89f</data>
