  <data key="d2">Antibiotic suppression tests demonstrated that PET depolymerization could occur even when intestinal microorganisms were inhibited.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests conducted to suppress gut microbiota in insect larvae using gentamicin sulfate to study its effect on PP biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibiotic suppression tests were used to indicate the gut microbe-dependence of PP depolymerization.</data>
