<node id="LB medium">
  <data key="d0">LB medium</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">LB medium was used to test the growth of gut bacteria and the effect of antibiotics.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a nutrient medium used to test growth of strain BIT-26T under different temperatures, pH values, and salt concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium was used to culture bacterial strains WJ2020 and WJ2025 for morphological observation.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a nutrient-rich growth medium used for culturing bacterial strains WJ2020 and WJ2025.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a culture medium used for the isolation of anaerobic polystyrene-degrading microorganisms.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a general growth medium used to estimate the total cultivable bacterial fraction in mealworm gut samples.&lt;SEP&gt;LB medium is a growth medium prepared with DI water, tryptone, yeast extract, NaCl, and agar, sterilized by autoclaving for microbial experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6f28f1c36076d1f249dbc4cd67b16f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d043948723ae25a365e297c98300be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77817419b966e501f1106866cbea7350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6fd56772ef66691cf6f1c613ba42e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68041096d198a27b4ed526281746b7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe29ef34ad1e5ab11c4ec7f5270fa94d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80979bb7e58b10bb558705b5d96fa99</data>
