  <data key="d0">DOI: 10.1021/acs.est.5b02663</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">This DOI refers to the digital identifier for the ACS Publications article containing the study and supporting information.&lt;SEP&gt;A digital object identifier (DOI) assigned to the publication 'Biodegradation and mineralization of polystyrene by plastic-eating mealworms: Part 2'.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8e38968f22c4cd9bef3f1562e4ca47e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a0e22d97687eaef3d31a60f7da6e668</data>
