  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society B is a scientific journal that published research on accumulation and fragmentation of plastic debris in global environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society B is the journal that published the 2009 article on plastics, the environment, and human health.&lt;SEP&gt;The journal in which Barnes et al. (2009) published their study on plastic debris.</data>
