  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Vitamin B6 metabolism is a metabolic pathway affected differently in BSF and WM larvae when exposed to plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Vitamin B6 metabolism was observed to be downregulated in larvae exposed to plastics, affecting multiple downstream pathways.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b</data>
