  <data key="d0">Pyrimidine Metabolism</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Pyrimidine metabolism is a metabolic pathway elevated in BSF larvae when reared on PET.&lt;SEP&gt;A nucleotide metabolism pathway observed downregulated in BSF larvae exposed to plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;This pathway, essential for RNA/DNA synthesis and protein glycosylation, is perturbed only in PS-H fed mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee6535da22915c7094098e016b19d80</data>
