  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Purine metabolism is a metabolic pathway strongly expressed in BSF larvae when reared on plastics other than PET.&lt;SEP&gt;A nucleotide metabolism pathway observed upregulated in BSF larvae exposed to plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Purine metabolism was elevated in Mealworm (MW), contributing to cofactor accumulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-939800f545beed77f5a7d1c026c250fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce341034979daadf1f9dc7037397d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae2c294948460ef392ceeec82d5e81f8</data>
