  <data key="d2">WM refers to Wax Moth larvae, which were studied for survival, larval weight, and metabolic effects when exposed to plastics and supplements.&lt;SEP&gt;WM refers to a model insect group, particularly noted for performing well on PLA and foam-based plastics in terms of CCM outputs.</data>
