  <data key="d2">The turbidity assay was used to differentiate bacterial growth from cloudiness caused by NPS in liquid medium.&lt;SEP&gt;Turbidity assay measures the reduction in cloudiness of a liquid medium caused by bacterial activity or NPS, assessed via absorbance readings at 650 nm.</data>
