<node id="Pseudomonas aeruginosa M2">
  <data key="d0">Pseudomonas aeruginosa M2</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A bacterial strain identified and deposited in NCBI with accession number PP126564.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas aeruginosa M2 is a bacterial isolate tested for its ability to degrade non-polar polystyrene (NPS). It showed turbidity removal of 30% and demonstrated enzymatic activity including lipase, esterase, laccase, catalase, oxidase, and protease.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas aeruginosa M2 (PP12654) is a microbial strain identified as a potential NPS degrader, showing 6% reduction in PS film weight.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas aeruginosa M2 is a bacterial strain identified as capable of degrading polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas aeruginosa M2 is a microorganism isolated from Tenebrio molitor, tested on NPS and PS film for 30 days, showing 6% biodegradation/weight loss.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-01bf9080cbf55e62c0b26d0e054bd1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf098ec253f99187f3c98d5d0589f7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939f85d52d9301668deab282264e5fd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bdcf1b4859e82ab15050837ab539dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3196d2d200ebf060e966a565b5eb26de</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756381118</data>
</node>
<node id="Pseudomonas stutzeri M3">
  <data key="d0">Pseudomonas stutzeri M3</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A bacterial strain identified and deposited in NCBI with accession number PP126565.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas stutzeri M3 is a bacterial isolate tested for NPS degradation. It showed 44% turbidity removal and enzymatic activity including laccase, catalase, oxidase, protease, and cellulase.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas stutzeri M3 (PP12655) is a microbial strain identified as a potential NPS degrader, showing 1.5% reduction in PS film weight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-01bf9080cbf55e62c0b26d0e054bd1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3196d2d200ebf060e966a565b5eb26de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55bdcf1b4859e82ab15050837ab539dc</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756381118</data>
</node>
