  <data key="d2">Phylogenetic tree is a diagram constructed using MEGA 11 software to show evolutionary relationships among bacterial strains.&lt;SEP&gt;Phylogenetic trees were constructed to analyze the evolutionary relationships of Achroia grisella.&lt;SEP&gt;A phylogenetic tree was constructed to classify the selected bacterial strains isolated from mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;The phylogenetic tree represents the evolutionary relationships of the selected bacterial strains, as shown in Fig. 3.</data>
