  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lou et al. (2021) conducted investigations into plastic degradation, reporting differences in survival and pupation rates across diet groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Lou et al. (2021) is a referenced study associated with microbiome studies of Enterobacter hormaechei.&lt;SEP&gt;Lou et al. (2021) is cited as the author group of a study mentioned in the text. No further description is available.&lt;SEP&gt;Lou and colleagues reported polyethylene (PE) foam plastics consumption and biodegradation by yellow mealworms.</data>
