  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tschatzis et al. (2021) performed metabolomic profiling to study polystyrene assimilation in larval guts, identifying the toxic compound 2,4-di-tert butylphenol.&lt;SEP&gt;Tschatzis et al. (2021) is cited as the author group of a study mentioned in the text. No further description is available.</data>
