<node id="Control Sample">
  <data key="d0">Control Sample</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The control sample is used as a baseline in experiments to compare against nanoplastic and bacterial-treated samples.&lt;SEP&gt;The control sample refers to the baseline group in which assumptions of the DEB model, such as strong and weak homeostasis, are tested without the addition of PS.&lt;SEP&gt;The control sample is used to estimate parameters such as kM and g0 under the assumption that f=1 and e=1.&lt;SEP&gt;The control sample is used as a reference for estimating parameters in the experiment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eee7e44e4c15567a057d7d295d240211&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dcd4cd232a018bcab118acc67b3f0f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf098ec253f99187f3c98d5d0589f7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-355ef52836a4c27f1290730187a78818</data>
