  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Achromobacter sp. LH-1 is a bacterial strain with a degradation capability of 94% for phenanthrene (PHE) and can break down various PAHs.&lt;SEP&gt;A biodemulsifier-producing bacterial strain studied for phenanthrene biodegradation.</data>
