  <data key="d2">Achromobacter sp. RX is a bacterial strain capable of degrading di(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP) through esterase-mediated de-esterification, achieving 91.7% mineralization within 96 hours.&lt;SEP&gt;A newly isolated bacterium capable of biodegrading di-(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate.</data>
