  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Mohan et al. 2016 is a cited research group/publication that studied the biodegradation of nanoplastystyrene emulsion and polystyrene film.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64e5cd2c08637934509262e56ab363</data>
