  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Klebsiella grimonitii Pseudomonas multiresinivorans is a microorganism isolated from Tenebrio molitor, tested on NPS and PS film for 60 days, showing 4.35% biodegradation/weight loss.</data>
