  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Cellulosimicrobium sp. WJ2025 is a microorganism isolated from Tenebrio molitor, tested on PS film for 20 days, showing cracks in PS film and biofilm formation.&lt;SEP&gt;A bacterial strain isolated from Tenebrio molitor intestines, capable of degrading polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-939f85d52d9301668deab282264e5fd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafca19c0156f11127587dba3673503</data>
