<node id="PE Frass">
  <data key="d0">PE Frass</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PE Frass is a byproduct related to Polyethylene with Mw of 71,483 ± 9,164 and Mn of 16,462 ± 2,330. It shows a 51.84% ± 9.26% reduction in Mw and 47.61% ± 8.49% reduction in Mn.&lt;SEP&gt;PE Frass refers to the frass collected from lesser waxworms fed polyethylene, analyzed for residual polymer content and chemical modifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf662c8e784d14a3a4dba2e89041aa4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25215becbc007a60f24b86a2d6aaf26</data>
