  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PE + Bran Frass is a mixture of Polyethylene and bran-derived frass with Mw of 88,898 ± 17,102 and Mn of 14,397 ± 2,334. It shows a 19.46% ± 7.66% reduction in Mw and 12.76% ± 3.15% reduction in Mn.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf662c8e784d14a3a4dba2e89041aa4a</data>
