  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">HT-GPC is an analytical method used to measure molecular weight changes in polymers during the experiment.&lt;SEP&gt;HT-GPC is an analytical method used to study molecular weight distributions of mixed polymers in the experiment.</data>
