  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PGF refers to the percentage of ingested plastic mass incorporated into mealworm biomass, measured for PE- and PS-fed mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17b1e554820493d86eb8bc96ba8bef37</data>
