  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">DESeq2 is a bioinformatics tool for moderated estimation of fold change and dispersion in RNA-seq data.&lt;SEP&gt;DESeq2 is an R package used for statistical analysis of differential abundance in microbiome datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;DESeq2 is a statistical tool used for differential abundance analysis of microbial taxa between PS and CT samples.&lt;SEP&gt;DESeq2 is a statistical tool used for differential abundance analysis in this study.&lt;SEP&gt;DESeq2 is a statistical method used for differential abundance analysis of fungi clustered by genus in PS and CT samples.&lt;SEP&gt;A statistical method for moderated estimation of fold change and dispersion in RNA-seq data.</data>
