<node id="Polystyrene Foam (PS)">
  <data key="d0">Polystyrene Foam (PS)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Polystyrene foam (PS) is a type of plastic tested as a diet for superworms and yellow mealworms. It was consumed at higher rates by superworms than by yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene foam (PS) is a type of plastic tested for ingestion and degradation by superworms and yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene foam is one of the plastic diets fed to worms in the experiment.</data>
