  <data key="d0">Polyurethane Foam (PU)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Polyurethane foam (PU) is a type of plastic tested as a diet for superworms and yellow mealworms. Both species showed similar consumption efficiency when adjusted for larval mass.&lt;SEP&gt;Polyurethane foam (PU) is a type of plastic tested for ingestion and degradation by superworms and yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Polyurethane foam is another plastic diet fed to worms in the experiment.</data>
