</node>
<node id="Fig. 6">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 6</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 6 presents associations between gut microbial community compositions and different diets as well as larval species.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 6 shows the microscopic observation of autoaggregation in Acinetobacter septicus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bfd05eac1abc28ac416e6a56ccd6a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df045e015825dac8935c9c6d8a402cda</data>
