  <data key="d2">Mixta gaviniae is a species of the genus Mixta, first isolated from infant formula and an infant formula production environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixta gaviniae is a species of the genus Mixta, included in phylogenetic analysis with strain BIT-26T.&lt;SEP&gt;Mixta gaviniae is a species within the genus Mixta, used as a phylogenetic and phenotypic comparison to strain BIT-26T.</data>
