<node id="WJ2020">
  <data key="d0">WJ2020</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">WJ2020 is a bacterial strain isolated and identified as capable of degrading PS film.&lt;SEP&gt;WJ2020 is a bacterial strain identified through 16S rRNA sequencing. It belongs to the genus Klebsiella and is 99% similar to Klebsiella aerogenes NBRC13534. It is capable of degrading PS films and promotes oxidation during the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;WJ2020 is a bacterial strain isolated from the gut of yellow mealworms. It is capable of degrading PS films, causing weight loss and molecular weight reduction through oxidation and other biochemical processes.&lt;SEP&gt;WJ2020 is a bacterial strain with the ability to degrade polystyrene (PS), reducing PS film mass by 4.35% over 60 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e6fd56772ef66691cf6f1c613ba42e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfcb17715cb4e5148b33061c1b6cbf1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9859524b7a6851b786570d2a704e34f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe29ef34ad1e5ab11c4ec7f5270fa94d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756381972</data>
</node>
<node id="WJ2025">
  <data key="d0">WJ2025</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">WJ2025 is a bacterial strain isolated and identified as capable of degrading PS film.&lt;SEP&gt;WJ2025 is a bacterial strain identified through 16S rRNA sequencing. It belongs to the genus Cellulosimicrobium and is 99% similar to Cellulosimicrobium funkei W6122. It is capable of degrading PS films and promotes oxidation during the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;WJ2025 is a bacterial strain isolated from the gut of yellow mealworms. It degrades PS films, leading to weight loss and molecular weight reduction, with stronger degradation effects than WJ2020.&lt;SEP&gt;WJ2025 is a bacterial strain with the ability to degrade polystyrene (PS), reducing PS film mass by 6.93% over 60 days.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e6fd56772ef66691cf6f1c613ba42e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfcb17715cb4e5148b33061c1b6cbf1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9859524b7a6851b786570d2a704e34f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe29ef34ad1e5ab11c4ec7f5270fa94d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756381972</data>
</node>
