<node id="PS films">
  <data key="d0">PS films</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PS films are polystyrene plastic films used in the experiments. They undergo degradation when incubated with bacterial strains such as WJ2020 and WJ2025.&lt;SEP&gt;PS films are polystyrene materials purchased from Goodfellow company for biodegradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;PS films are polystyrene films used as a carbon source in biodegradation assays.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eafea2357c59ac6712f4d9ab41ac5d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9859524b7a6851b786570d2a704e34f3</data>
