  <data key="d0">ATSDR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ATSDR is cited in the text as a source regarding the environmental and health risks of polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agency for Toxic Substances and Disease Registry published a toxicological profile for styrene in 1992.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54</data>
