  <data key="d0">CIWMB</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CIWMB is cited in the text as a source regarding the environmental and health risks of polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The California Integrated Waste Management Board published a report on use and disposal of polystyrene in California in 2004.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54</data>
