  <data key="d2">Lacounty Gove is cited in the text as a source regarding the environmental and health risks of polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Lacounty Gove is associated with a 2008 overview of expanded polystyrene food containers in Los Angeles County.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4e540abd667582c77f4d2222836147ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c</data>
