<node id="WHO">
  <data key="d0">WHO</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">WHO is cited in the text as a source reporting carcinogenic results of styrene oxide.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization reported in 2000 that HFCs could reduce body weight and cause liver lesions in laboratory mammals.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Health Organization (WHO) declared the end of the global Covid-19 health emergency in 2023.&lt;SEP&gt;WHO (World Health Organization) declared the end of the global health emergency related to Covid-19.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f4c282fe2323dc6e310501af888c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4da90774e2e5cb1fea30fd5aa390760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3cec3addc1bee202783dff1583ba54</data>
