<node id="Yang et al., 2015a; 2015b">
  <data key="d0">Yang et al., 2015a; 2015b</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang and colleagues are cited researchers who reported that mealworms fed solely on styrofoam were able to survive for a month, highlighting the role of gut bacteria in biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756382401</data>
