<node id="Biodegradation of Polystyrene in Yellow Mealworms (Tenebrio molitor) Larvae">
  <data key="d0">Biodegradation of Polystyrene in Yellow Mealworms (Tenebrio molitor) Larvae</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">This is a scientific study investigating the biodegradation of polystyrene in yellow mealworms (Tenebrio molitor) larvae, focusing on factors such as temperature, moisture, and food sources.</data>
