  <data key="d2">Temperature is identified as a factor influencing the rate of polystyrene biodegradation by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;An experimental variable tested at 20 °C, 25 °C, and 30 °C to assess its effect on PS degradation and mealworm survival.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c16f995987af72f86486559556052e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38e212e8bab88c4d7b6d63a157e27c00</data>
