<node id="$^{1}$H NMR">
  <data key="d0">$^{1}$H NMR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">$^{1}$H NMR (proton nuclear magnetic resonance) was used to analyze physiochemical changes in frass.&lt;SEP&gt;$^{1}$H NMR (Proton Nuclear Magnetic Resonance) was used to analyze egested frass of A. grisea larvae, confirming biodegradation of polyethylene.</data>
