<node id="Larval stage">
  <data key="d0">Larval stage</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The larval stage is the developmental stage of the lesser waxworm during which it consumes food such as WC or PE.&lt;SEP&gt;The larval stage is a developmental phase of lesser waxworms, with duration affected by diet type and environmental conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The larval stage is a developmental phase where pupal reserves are supplied from larva structures and reserves, not the reproduction buffer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-998b63e5349034d477c2087c139669ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab6b219720db5a6e3384c884c280984c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5af82472112cbc9e76b1fd1ac6e8c54e</data>
