  <data key="d0">Cocoon</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cocoons are spun by mature waxworms during the last instar stage and later develop into pupae.&lt;SEP&gt;Cocoons are spun by late instar stage larvae either on crumpled paper or PE film surfaces before pupation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f2303f3680e9313daac77bb7e27e7da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5af82472112cbc9e76b1fd1ac6e8c54e</data>
