  <data key="d0">WC (Waxcomb)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">WC is the natural diet of the lesser waxworm and was used as a control and co-feed in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Waxcomb (WC) is the conventional food for lesser waxworms, made of beeswax produced by honey bees to raise larvae and store honey and pollen.</data>
