  <data key="d2">A combined diet of polyethylene (PE) and waxcomb (WC) in equal mass ratio, used to study the feeding and degradation behavior of lesser waxworms.&lt;SEP&gt;PE-WC co-feed is a combined diet of polyethylene and waxcomb given to lesser waxworms to study effects on biodegradation and growth.</data>
