  <data key="d2">Yang et al. 2014 is a cited reference reporting that larvae of the Indian meal moth house PE-degrading bacteria in their digestive tract.&lt;SEP&gt;A cited scientific study reporting that Indian meal moth larvae contain PE-degrading bacteria in their digestive tract.</data>
