  <data key="d0">Survival rate (SR)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Survival rate (SR) refers to the percentage of lesser waxworms that survived under different feeding conditions (WC, PE, PE-WC).&lt;SEP&gt;Survival rate (SR) is the percentage of larvae that survived under different feeding conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab6b219720db5a6e3384c884c280984c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df147b253e29abfa812d060407051e45</data>
