<node id="Microplastics in Terrestrial Environments">
  <data key="d0">Microplastics in Terrestrial Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Microplastics in terrestrial environments are described as emerging contaminants and major challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics in Terrestrial Environments is a publication volume referenced in the text, published by Springer, containing research on biodegradation of plastics in Tenebrio genus.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a31a12c930b59b872c94dda484d0db4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3745cb01a4209e2eae28914dde3b52</data>
