<node id="Plastic Polymers">
  <data key="d0">Plastic Polymers</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Plastic polymers are studied in co-lysis with lignin.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic polymers are synthetic materials with covalent carbon bonds, described as having low bioreactivity and poor nutritional value for mealworms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb16cd27b6682965375050748ee77862&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3745cb01a4209e2eae28914dde3b52</data>
