  <data key="d0">Ecosystems</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Ecosystems are described as being affected by microplastics in agricultural soils.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecosystems are the natural environments into which excreted plastic fragments from macroinvertebrates eventually enter.</data>
