<node id="Dried Whey">
  <data key="d0">Dried Whey</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Dried whey is tested as a feed for Tenebrio molitor, resulting in lower larval mortality but slower development.&lt;SEP&gt;Dried whey is a type of feed used in the experiment to rear Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Dried whey was used as a protein-rich feed in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Dried whey is a type of feed used in the experiment with mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Dried whey was used as a feed in the experiment, showing relatively high mortality and occasional cannibalism among larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Dried Whey is one of the feed types used in the study to rear larvae, and its fatty acid content was measured.&lt;SEP&gt;Dried whey is a type of feed analyzed for its fatty acid composition, showing varying proportions of saturated, monoenoic, and polyenoic fatty acids.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cbf28f07f3e46b29e447aae784667c29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb542a26376f51c3cd9247fe3d56854&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8a706f2bd66291a3ef925114ffd9300&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b6629e8c030ab3162553d83aa6eca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d01d291012bd548fc067e250ec39fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-531058c4540bd4e6a50d141db01d4d11</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
