  <data key="d0">Ware Potatoes</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ware potatoes are a type of feed used in the experiment to rear Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Ware potatoes are a type of feed used in the experiment with mealworms, associated with the lowest mortality.&lt;SEP&gt;Ware potatoes were used as a feed in the experiment, showing low mortality in some phases but also developmental problems where individuals could not transition from pupae to adults.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-531058c4540bd4e6a50d141db01d4d11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbf28f07f3e46b29e447aae784667c29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5b6629e8c030ab3162553d83aa6eca4</data>
