<node id="Excrement">
  <data key="d0">Excrement</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Excrement samples were collected from larvae fed on different feeds, except in the bran-fed group where isolation was not possible.&lt;SEP&gt;Excrement from mealworm larvae was analyzed for fatty acid content, showing similar ratios to larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Excrement refers broadly to the waste products of macroinvertebrates, through which plastic fragments are released into ecosystems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02e6f7bbb2c1ef92c57b423020b0cc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba22196a59b67cbf67af7d76a039af1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a170da66288c73388872b8a43fa51e33</data>
