  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Feed refers to the different dietary inputs (wheat bran, dried whey, ware potatoes, polystyrene, EPS, XPS) provided to larvae in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Feed is a general feed type used in the study to rear larvae, and its fatty acid content was measured.</data>
