  <data key="d0">Galleria mellonella (Greater Wax Moth)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Galleria mellonella, also known as the greater wax moth, is an insect larva with the ability to biodegrade polystyrene (PS). Its gut microbiome diversity increased after feeding on PS.</data>
