  <data key="d0">Zophobas atratus (Superworm)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Zophobas atratus, also known as the superworm, is an insect larva with the strongest PS consumption capacity and highest survival rate among the studied species. It degrades PS into low-molecular-weight substances.&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus is a species of darkling beetle larvae capable of biodegrading plastics such as PS and LDPE.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-694aaaa7c2839ea048d46b6a2bb13748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91ffc7c76e8e0a1757d91f7cf62f568</data>
