  <data key="d2">Kocuria rosea is a species of Kocuria demonstrated to degrade malachite green, a compound with a styrene core structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Kocuria rosea is a microorganism demonstrated to degrade malachite green, a chemical compound used as a textile dye and antimicrobial in aquaculture.</data>
