<node id="Starvation group">
  <data key="d0">Starvation group</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The starvation group was a control group in the experiment where larvae were not fed plastic or bran.&lt;SEP&gt;The starvation group refers to larvae that were not fed, serving as a control to compare survival and weight changes against larvae fed with MPs or bran.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9d7500fe4985cb2b885f9eb244ed3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdc8398efba587929eebd0a0842f6e69</data>
