  <data key="d0">Nanopore sequencing</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nanopore sequencing is a sequencing technology used to identify degradative enzymes in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanopore sequencing was used to analyze the genome of strain LG3 to identify key enzymes involved in PS degradation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f91980be083a0bf5b52d43a640e9d787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7cbc8be34e0de8aebc6fd547bacc627</data>
