<node id="Alkyl hydroperoxide reductase C (ahpC)">
  <data key="d0">Alkyl hydroperoxide reductase C (ahpC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Alkyl hydroperoxide reductase C (ahpC) is one of the degradative enzymes identified in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3.&lt;SEP&gt;Alkyl hydroperoxide reductase C (ahpC) is a gene upregulated in LG3 after Mi-PS treatment, part of the peroxidase family.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f91980be083a0bf5b52d43a640e9d787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7cbc8be34e0de8aebc6fd547bacc627</data>
