  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipid A is a cellular component that was upregulated in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3 during polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipid A is an essential toxic component of endotoxin, associated with opportunistic pathogens such as Enterobacter hormaechei.</data>
