<node id="Anaerobic Conditions">
  <data key="d0">Anaerobic Conditions</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Anaerobic conditions refer to oxygen-limited environments, such as the gut of mealworms, where plastic biodegradation is being investigated.&lt;SEP&gt;Anaerobic conditions refer to the oxygen-free environment under which bacterial degradation of PS films was studied.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eafea2357c59ac6712f4d9ab41ac5d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345c72af5aa26d5c4e06d7df5d8a1c85</data>
