<node id="Oxygen-limited Environment">
  <data key="d0">Oxygen-limited Environment</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The oxygen-limited environment refers to the gut conditions of mealworms, where anaerobic bacteria such as Clostridium, Enterobacter, and Spiroplasma reside.</data>
