<node id="PS Emulsion">
  <data key="d0">PS Emulsion</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PS emulsion is a preparation made by dissolving PS foams in dichloromethane, mixing with sarkosyl NL, sonication, and dilution with distilled water, followed by evaporation and filtration to obtain a suspension of PS particles.</data>
