  <data key="d2">Enrichment culture refers to the cultivation process using gut and frass samples from larvae with PS foams to establish microbial populations capable of degrading PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Enrichment culture lasting fifty-six days was used to increase the population of intestinal microorganisms before isolation.</data>
