<node id="FMM medium">
  <data key="d0">FMM medium</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">FMM medium is a growth medium used in biodegradation assays for culturing bacteria with PS films as a carbon source.&lt;SEP&gt;FMM medium is a growth medium used in experiments, supplemented with microspheres or maltose monohydrate for bacterial inoculation.&lt;SEP&gt;FMM medium is a culture medium used in experiments to test PS degradation under aerobic and anaerobic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;FMM medium contained Mi-PS at 0.075% (w/v) concentration and was used for incubation under anaerobic conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f91980be083a0bf5b52d43a640e9d787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e81a4fde1bdef8287df342fc27193de6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d80979bb7e58b10bb558705b5d96fa99</data>
