<node id="Mi-PS">
  <data key="d0">Mi-PS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Mi-PS is a material supplemented into FMM medium for SPME/GC-MS analysis experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Mi-PS is a supplement added to FMM medium at 0.075% concentration.&lt;SEP&gt;Mi-PS refers to a type of polystyrene material used as a substrate in biodegradation experiments with bacterial strains.&lt;SEP&gt;Mi-PS is a substance included in the FMM medium and used in experiments to study biodegradation under anaerobic and aerobic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Mi-PS refers to modified polystyrene used as a treatment condition in experiments with LG3. It induces changes in gene expression, metabolic pathways, and physiological activities in LG3.&lt;SEP&gt;Mi-PS refers to a form of polystyrene used in the study to test bacterial degradation and gene expression responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-237dcdbb783e27ec19d2ebc6b854b744&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91523cdd8f510a966e9b301a0adb96b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f91980be083a0bf5b52d43a640e9d787&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a889b716cac361e6e04405777075076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc545cfe4d6e8e04c3698a149d4101a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-050a4c71685bf71165985a79f528ed58</data>
