<node id="Strain LG3">
  <data key="d0">Strain LG3</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Strain LG3 is a bacterium isolated from the gut of late-instar PS-fed larvae. It exhibits high anaerobic and aerobic polystyrene (PS)-degrading activity, showing significant weight reduction of PS films under both conditions.</data>
