  <data key="d0">Strain SCGB1</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Strain SCGB1 is a bacterium belonging to the same species as Bacillus amyloliquefaciens. It is reported as both a polyethylene (PE)- and polystyrene (PS)-degrading organism, but in this study, it showed effective PS degradation only under aerobic conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d80979bb7e58b10bb558705b5d96fa99</data>
