  <data key="d0">E. hormaechei LG3</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">E. hormaechei LG3 is a bacterial strain tested for its ability to degrade polystyrene (PS) films on agar plates.&lt;SEP&gt;E. hormaechei LG3 is a bacterial strain tested for its effect on PS films, including weight change and biodegradation activity.&lt;SEP&gt;E. hormaechei LG3 is a bacterial strain from the Enterobacter genus that showed the highest anaerobic PS-degrading activity among isolated strains and also degraded PS under aerobic conditions.</data>
