<node id="B. amyloliquefaciens SCGB1">
  <data key="d0">B. amyloliquefaciens SCGB1</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">B. amyloliquefaciens SCGB1 is a bacterial strain tested for its ability to degrade PS films under anaerobic conditions, showing different activity patterns compared to LG3.&lt;SEP&gt;B. amyloliquefaciens SCGB1 is a gut commensal bacterium with reduced PS degradation activity under anaerobic conditions, producing metabolites such as isobutyric acid and isovaleric acid in the presence of oxygen.&lt;SEP&gt;B. amyloliquefaciens SCGB1 is a PS-degrading bacterium with distinct metabolic characteristics, used for comparison with E. hormaechei LG3.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fcc545cfe4d6e8e04c3698a149d4101a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91523cdd8f510a966e9b301a0adb96b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-345c72af5aa26d5c4e06d7df5d8a1c85</data>
