<node id="Acetylene Reduction Assay">
  <data key="d0">Acetylene Reduction Assay</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Acetylene reduction assay is an experimental method used to measure nitrogen-fixing activity in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;A biochemical method used to test nitrogen fixation activity in mealworm gut microbes by measuring acetylene reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Acetylene reduction assay is the method used to examine nitrogen-fixing activity in mealworms by measuring the conversion of acetylene to ethylene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b12451ba2a22e6f74c543f982a0a7b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89c37eb3e3a5b6ab731f5dbe280aa054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813b71242f366f10218c10631cd7dee8</data>
