<node id="Termite">
  <data key="d0">Termite</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Termite is an insect that feeds on nitrogen-deficient wood diets and has been demonstrated to fix nitrogen with the help of gut bacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Termites are comparison organisms with much lower nitrogen-fixing activity than Styrofoam-eating mealworms.</data>
