  <data key="d0">UV radiation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">UV radiation is described as a factor causing surface oxidation and aging of PE microplastics, facilitating biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;UV radiation contributes to the surface oxidation and aging of PE, reducing hydrophobicity and facilitating microbial adhesion and degradation.</data>
