  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Microbial community refers to microorganisms that adhere to oxidized polymer surfaces in aged PE, aiding in biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The microbial community in the gut of T. molitor larvae adheres to aged PE polymers and contributes to their decomposition.</data>
