  <data key="d0">Yurong Liu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yurong Liu is listed as one of the authors of the study on plastic biodegradation in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Yurong Liu is an author affiliated with the Key Laboratory of Smart Manufacturing in Energy Chemical Process, Ministry of Education, East China University of Science and Technology, Shanghai, China.</data>
