  <data key="d0">Freshwater Amphipod (Gammarus duebeni)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Freshwater amphipods are organisms that rapidly fragment polyethylene microplastics into a wide range of sizes, including nanoplastics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84a8f1c256b1141b6bd2b404e817dfb7</data>
