<node id="Zophobas atratus larvae">
  <data key="d0">Zophobas atratus larvae</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Zophobas atratus larvae are macroinvertebrates with plastic-degrading capacities.&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus larvae are plastic-degrading invertebrates suggested for future research on microplastic-induced oxidative stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus larvae are plastic-degrading invertebrates suggested for follow-up research on microplastic-induced oxidative stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus larvae are insects studied for their ability to biodegrade polystyrene and polyethylene.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47e7fe379fcd6b17740bc4d953cd3b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44f9d05edb3efaf7fdb8f0f1517549&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-937d9d4e1671351e8e90f0bd2647f321</data>
