  <data key="d0">Intestinal Tissues of T. molitor larvae</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The intestinal tissues of Tenebrio molitor larvae secrete emulsifying components (30–100 kDa) that mediate PS bioavailability.</data>
