  <data key="d0">Intestinal Microbial Community</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The intestinal microbial community in mealworms produces substances (&lt;30 kDa) that increase microbiological respiration and contribute to plastic biodegradation.</data>
