  <data key="d2">Commercial polystyrene foams are identified as materials used in the study of biodegradation in mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Commercial PS foams are a form of polystyrene reported to be degraded by Enterobacteriaceae in Tenebrionidae insects.</data>
