</node>
<node id="Volumetric Length of Reserve (L_E)">
  <data key="d0">Volumetric Length of Reserve (L_E)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Volumetric length of reserve (L_E) is a measured variable representing the volumetric length of stored reserves.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-355ef52836a4c27f1290730187a78818</data>
