  <data key="d0">Energy in Reserve (E)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Energy in reserve (E) is a measured variable representing the amount of energy stored in reserves.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-355ef52836a4c27f1290730187a78818</data>
