  <data key="d0">Larvae pupation</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of larvae pupation is discussed in the context of reproduction buffer density and energy allocation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-998b63e5349034d477c2087c139669ed</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756388213</data>
</node>
<node id="Imago stage">
  <data key="d0">Imago stage</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The imago stage is a later developmental stage where energy from the reproduction buffer is used for egg production.&lt;SEP&gt;The imago stage is the adult stage of T. molitor during which eggs can be produced.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e819d53f76bcab4b74eba714efd32163&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-998b63e5349034d477c2087c139669ed</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
