  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (19) describes the energy flux from reserves into the reproduction buffer, later simplified for larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Equation (19) is a referenced mathematical model related to energy allocation and reproduction scaling.</data>
