  <data key="d2">Starvation 1 refers to a subgroup of larvae deprived of food, used to measure survival rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Starvation 1 refers to an experimental group of larvae subjected to a condition with no food availability, leading to decreased volumetric length and reserve density.</data>
