  <data key="d2">Inequality (18) is a criterion mentioned in the study to evaluate whether larvae had sufficient reserves for somatic maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;Inequality (18) is a criterion used in the experiment to determine whether larvae had sufficient reserves for somatic maintenance and development.</data>
