<edge source="Yellow Mealworms" target="Polyether-PU">
  <data key="d6">10.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Yellow mealworms were shown to chew and ingest polyether-PU foam, leading to partial biodegradation and mass loss.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,feeding</data>
