</edge>
<edge source="Yellow Mealworms" target="PP (Polypropylene)">
  <data key="d6">25.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Previous studies showed mealworms could consume polypropylene, similar to polyether-PU.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms were fed with PP foam as a sole diet to test survival, weight changes, and plastic consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms consumed PP, which showed limited depolymerization in their gut.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,comparative study,diet,experimental diet,plastic consumption,plastic degradation</data>
