<edge source="Polystyrene (PS)" target="Styrofoam">
  <data key="d6">84.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The relation between **Polystyrene (PS) and Styrofoam** refers to the fact that Styrofoam is a commercial and widely recognized form of polystyrene, specifically expanded polystyrene (EPS). While the term "Styrofoam" is often used colloquially to describe polystyrene products in general, it is technically a trade name for EPS, which is created by expanding polystyrene beads into a lightweight, foam-like material. This expanded form is commonly used in packaging, insulation, and construction due to its low density, cushioning properties, and thermal resistance.  

Styrofoam, like other polystyrene products, is composed of the polymer polystyrene, which can undergo decomposition into styrene monomers and other byproducts. This chemical composition has made Styrofoam a subject of scientific analysis, particularly in studies of degradation and biodegradation, as researchers investigate its environmental persistence and potential pathways for breakdown.  

Overall, Styrofoam represents a specific, expanded form of polystyrene that has become one of the most recognizable and widely used applications of the material, while also being associated with significant environmental challenges due to its durability and resistance to natural degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Styrofoam is the most popular form of polystyrene.</data>
  <data key="d8">commercial use,decomposition,derivative,experimental material,material classification,material composition,material identity,material type,material-product relationship,product application,terminology</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-1b0664a95aeeb896dcab096b098c3b54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-457d054c08a16428ed81526fc2ddce41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56c8b21b1eaba7633b49cea16714ddc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-497648a1cf8e41fac896250ae1eebbb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0ec64a7c629b14bfb6652f1960a337c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7fa795762aa89809d8221dc9dda92fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e10966ec80ea585746639b6be7e04e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a54f7d9e0a43fb94e2fc35f93656fc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a221e0c62ecd5a2502ec0a4473ab0999</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1756388250</data>
</edge>
