<edge source="Mealworms" target="PVC (Polyvinyl Chloride)">
  <data key="d6">47.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Mealworms ingested PVC microplastics, with varying crystalline structure changes depending on region.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms were fed with PVC microplastics, but only those from Tai'an and Shenzhen metabolized it.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms consumed PVC in smaller amounts, with varying results across sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms consumed PVC at low rates, showing limited degradation ability.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms ingested PVC microplastics, which showed partial degradation, limited mineralization, and toxic byproduct release.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms did not greatly consume PVC, but gut bacteria may contribute to its biodegradation.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,consumption,diet,diet experiment,digestion,gut microbiome,limited consumption,plastic degradation,selective metabolism,toxicity</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77a9d70651c9f13362e4c1e3ce10eab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc88563632a3abf926bf4e4ac16973fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236f4db8df75799fa6a0a07921158cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d8b17fc7993bee31f7e07e4db97cfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475b22fe6100b14cced604f739663fe4</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1756387893</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mealworms" target="LDPE (Low-Density Polyethylene)">
  <data key="d6">50.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Mealworms ingested LDPE microplastics, leading to crystalline structure transformation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms were fed with LDPE microplastics and were able to metabolize it across all regions.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms consumed LDPE in relatively small amounts, showing limited preference.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms consumed LDPE at low rates, but still demonstrated some degradation ability.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms ingested and degraded LDPE foam, with over 70% removal efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms ingested LDPE foam, leading to biodegradation and residual particles in frass.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,consumption,diet,diet experiment,digestion,low consumption,metabolism,plastic degradation,plastic ingestion</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-490fdb90ad8a65d35f3c2cd42a8c4c8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e45f9527e7b07e945435dae572dc387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-236f4db8df75799fa6a0a07921158cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb3c133fa4d5851f0feff55507c6874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21d8b17fc7993bee31f7e07e4db97cfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475b22fe6100b14cced604f739663fe4</data>
