<edge source="PS" target="Tenebrio molitor larvae">
  <data key="d6">44.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The larvae consumed PS foam and caused depolymerization, reducing molecular weight distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consumed and depolymerized PS foam.&lt;SEP&gt;The larvae ingested and degraded PS microplastics, with moderate consumption rates.&lt;SEP&gt;PS-fed larvae showed oxidative stress and damage, though less severe than PVC.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae were studied for their ability to biodegrade PS.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,experimental study,ingestion,oxidative stress,plastic consumption,toxicity</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-22ae90a77be18cbac99e5441d47ce2d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c64d0f1648a87497fbcae56f3089b417&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17052974ec1c317689bf07f0684f130f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4df787efdb36123e3f2a76b5402278ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb14281b4a095b6c531146d40b5110a1</data>
