<edge source="Frass" target="Mealworm larvae">
  <data key="d6">34.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Frass was analyzed to determine the extent of digestion and biodegradation of PE microplastics by mealworm larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Frass from mealworm larvae contains undigested residual plastic particles after PE ingestion and biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Frass, the waste material of mealworm larvae, was considered in degradation efficiency calculations.</data>
