<edge source="Frass" target="Mealworm">
  <data key="d6">52.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Frass was produced by mealworms after feeding on PS and barley bran, used for biodegradation assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic residuals were detected in the frass of mealworms after ingesting polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms excrete frass containing plastic residuals and depolymerization products of MPS.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworm frass contained 31.7% to 45.4% of plastic remnants.&lt;SEP&gt;Increased glycerol was detected in frass of mealworms, indicating enzymatic hydrolysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms excrete part of ingested Styrofoam as frass.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,biodegradation output,digestion byproduct,excretion,metabolic stress,plastic degradation,plastic residuals,waste analysis,waste excretion</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-3646a65acc7cbdc1d20742888b17613a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fc215d3abb38f76b4ee0d22c4f1eb11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e4030ea35bee29093c1a8f19bc90774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84558838faaf585c61e883356c52c0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a221e0c62ecd5a2502ec0a4473ab0999</data>
