<edge source="Bran" target="Mealworm larvae">
  <data key="d6">26.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Mealworm larvae were fed bran as a control and in combination with PE microplastics to compare digestion and growth outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran supplementation in the diet of mealworm larvae reduces oxidative stress, improves biomass and survival, but alters PE removal efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Supplementing bran improved biomass and survival of larvae but reduced PE removal efficiency.</data>
