<edge source="PS (Polystyrene)" target="Diet 1">
  <data key="d6">24.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Diet 1 involved feeding Tenebrio molitor larvae with barley and PS, leading to higher degradation compound levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 1 included PS at a 4:1 bran to PS ratio.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 1 resulted in higher excretion of PS oligomers and greater depolymerization compared to Diet 2.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,depolymerization,diet composition,diet effect,feeding experiment</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-5a708f09b97ac93da05bd1d20bdfe174&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395b01f15fd97b70e2368941120e9a37</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1756382664</data>
</edge>
<edge source="PS (Polystyrene)" target="Diet 2">
  <data key="d6">24.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Diet 2 involved feeding Tenebrio molitor larvae with bran and PS, associated with higher cholesterol levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 2 included PS at a 20:1 bran to PS ratio with water.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 2 showed a lower excretion of PS oligomers and a smaller reduction in molecular weight compared to Diets 1 and 3, indicating different biodegradation dynamics.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,diet composition,diet effect,feeding experiment,metabolic effect</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-5a708f09b97ac93da05bd1d20bdfe174&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395b01f15fd97b70e2368941120e9a37</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1756382666</data>
</edge>
<edge source="PS (Polystyrene)" target="Diet 3">
  <data key="d6">22.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Diet 3 involved feeding Tenebrio molitor larvae with PS under conditions requiring the least handling.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 3 included PS at a 20:1 bran to PS ratio without water.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 3, like Diet 1, showed higher depolymerization rates compared to Diet 2, indicating water inclusion affects PS degradation.</data>
  <data key="d8">depolymerization,diet composition,diet effect,experimental design,feeding experiment</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-5a708f09b97ac93da05bd1d20bdfe174&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395b01f15fd97b70e2368941120e9a37</data>
