<edge source="T. molitor" target="Polystyrene">
  <data key="d6">54.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Bacteria in the digestive tract of T. molitor are involved in polystyrene degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene is degraded by T. molitor in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor was studied for its ability to consume polystyrene and the effects on its nutrient composition.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor was fed polystyrene in the study to observe biodegradation effects.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor survival rates were tested in habitats containing only polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor digestive tract bacteria are capable of degrading polystyrene, especially oxo-degradable polystyrene.</data>
