<edge source="Mealworm larvae" target="Oxidative stress">
  <data key="d6">19.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Feeding mealworm larvae polyethylene microplastics induces oxidative stress.&lt;SEP&gt;PE ingestion and biodegradation induce oxidative stress in mealworm larvae, damaging tissues and reducing survival.</data>
  <data key="d8">biological effect,oxidative damage,physiological stress,stress response</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-1175f4bdc5e5c267806fa6c0ff19fcc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f7d44b3f99233bb4389ceea0cd62617</data>
