<edge source="T. molitor larvae" target="LDPE">
  <data key="d6">55.0</data>
  <data key="d7">T. molitor larvae were previously fed LDPE as a sole diet in other studies.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor larvae consumed LDPE, but it provided limited nutritional value.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor larvae ingest LDPE as part of their ability to consume various plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;The larvae were fed LDPE to study its biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor larvae were fed LDPE to test biodegradation and survival outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor larvae biodegraded LDPE, but the depolymerization pattern changed.&lt;SEP&gt;LDPE was mentioned as a polymer previously studied for degradation by T. molitor larvae.</data>
