<edge source="HDPE" target="T. obscurus">
  <data key="d6">102.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The relation **(HDPE, T. obscurus)** refers to the interaction between high-density polyethylene (HDPE), a widely used plastic, and the larvae of *Tenebrio obscurus*, a darkling beetle species studied for its potential role in plastic biodegradation. Research has shown that *T. obscurus* larvae are capable of ingesting and partially biodegrading HDPE, although the extent of degradation is limited compared to other plastics such as low-density polyethylene (LDPE) and linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE). Experimental studies have involved feeding the larvae HDPE in various forms, including microplastics, to assess both the biodegradation process and the physiological impacts on the insects.  

The larvae demonstrated measurable biodegradation effects, including evidence of depolymerization, though the efficiency was relatively low. Ingestion of HDPE was associated with oxidative stress responses in the larvae, indicating that the process imposes physiological strain. These experiments also examined the nutritional consequences of feeding on HDPE, as the plastic does not provide adequate sustenance, further influencing larval health and metabolism.  

Overall, the relation highlights that while *T. obscurus* larvae can consume and initiate biodegradation of HDPE, the process is limited in efficiency and accompanied by stress-related biological impacts. This suggests that *T. obscurus* has potential as a biological model for studying plastic degradation, but its effectiveness in breaking down HDPE is constrained compared to other polyethylene types.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,biodegradation experiment,experiment,experimental diet,experimental feeding,feeding behavior,ingestion,limited effect,plastic consumption,plastic degradation,polymer breakdown,toxicity</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc908e62eec4d1d05265c6e451cca84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8c6850a83a1c6efd4f1a3a37a0a8181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2169963c4d6dae9b98da331d39eaa72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd73d3cca5434181ee9dd1ad1b8f8ab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3380732c060363504db5f6e4b8610b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-988ef111808996ddbe6e483d6505ab45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd4d84d6de496440fcabc6616d1c96ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f75b58db5211fc7348ccca8206b9bbae</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1756383359</data>
</edge>
