<edge source="Tenebrio molitor larvae" target="White EPS">
  <data key="d6">17.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The larvae consumed white EPS, which resulted in higher mortality and larger frass particle size.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consumed white EPS, though at a slower rate due to higher material density.</data>
  <data key="d8">biodegradation,biological interaction,material consumption,material degradation</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-110013d54a5fd492446b1fe049a60fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df3b1ec42b9ac5c08513c3b568a399</data>
