  <data key="d11">1756377672</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tenebrio molitor larvae" target="Grey EPS">
  <data key="d6">18.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The larvae consumed grey EPS, which was fully removed and produced frass with higher phosphorus content and more chemical modifications.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consumed grey EPS faster than white EPS, likely due to its composition.</data>
